(370867, 30994, 9809, '<td valign="top">That''s either one big @$$ bug, or you''re real close :) <br/>I like the angle and framing, even though the wing is clipped off. For some reason though, the front of the link in the chain keeps drawing my eye -- perhaps because this seems to be the main focus point. Still, a nice photo.</td>', 'That''s either one big @$$ bug, or you''re real close :) I like the angle and framing, even though the wing is clipped off. For some reason though, the front of the link in the chain keeps drawing my eye -- perhaps because this seems to be the main focus point. Still, a nice photo.', '2003-07-30 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(370868, 30143, 3569, '<td valign="top">Ah a standard....my would destroy any garden loking for balls.  nice capture.</td>', 'Ah a standard....my would destroy any garden loking for balls.  nice capture.', '2003-07-30 12:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
