(370874, 30516, 9809, '<td valign="top">Cute goat. You''ve clipped off his tail though. I''m not one who demands that the entire body be in a photo -- you could have cropped from the middle of his back right foot up, and then across his hip on the top to make it look like you were trying to enforce the idea of his intrusion into the garden. Also, some light on his face would be good. The left eye is lost in the darkness.</td>', 'Cute goat. You''ve clipped off his tail though. I''m not one who demands that the entire body be in a photo -- you could have cropped from the middle of his back right foot up, and then across his hip on the top to make it look like you were trying to enforce the idea of his intrusion into the garden. Also, some light on his face would be good. The left eye is lost in the darkness.', '2003-07-30 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(370875, 31002, 3569, '<td valign="top">to bad their doing renavation when you were there. good shot.</td>', 'to bad their doing renavation when you were there. good shot.', '2003-07-30 12:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
