(370948, 30520, 3087, '<td valign="top">I played with this a little in photoshop and this is how I like it best... I rotated it by 2.16 degrees counter clockwise. I then cropped it in from the left to excluse all the foreground flowers at the front. (Not because I don''t like those but because I wasn''t keen on the centred composition). I also cropped up from the bottom. Anyway, I like the photo a lot and hope you wont take offence at my messing around with ideas for it. The copy I took has now been deleted from my hard drive completely.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I played with this a little in photoshop and this is how I like it best... I rotated it by 2.16 degrees counter clockwise. I then cropped it in from the left to excluse all the foreground flowers at the front. (Not because I don''t like those but because I wasn''t keen on the centred composition). I also cropped up from the bottom. Anyway, I like the photo a lot and hope you wont take offence at my messing around with ideas for it. The copy I took has now been deleted from my hard drive completely.Kavey', '2003-07-30 13:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(370949, 31206, 10219, '<td valign="top">I know what Koi are, but for someone who didn''t they may have trouble with this blurry fish, it''s not my favorite, but I don''t hate it, so we''re going to go right in the middle with a 5</td>', 'I know what Koi are, but for someone who didn''t they may have trouble with this blurry fish, it''s not my favorite, but I don''t hate it, so we''re going to go right in the middle with a 5', '2003-07-30 13:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
