(370953, 30535, 10219, '<td valign="top">Good contrast, good focus, GREAT IDEA - 8</td>', 'Good contrast, good focus, GREAT IDEA - 8', '2003-07-30 13:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(370955, 31192, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like your title. The plants in the front are a nice bright contrast to the darker vegetation in the back as is the white of the feeder. I think maybe cropping the feeder more to the right might give the photo a more artistic feel.</td>', 'I like your title. The plants in the front are a nice bright contrast to the darker vegetation in the back as is the white of the feeder. I think maybe cropping the feeder more to the right might give the photo a more artistic feel.', '2003-07-30 13:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(370956, 30303, 3087, '<td valign="top">Although in one sense I like the way you''ve caught two butterflies together, in another sense, the recognisable shape of a butterfly wing has been lost and I''m not sure that works for me... I do like the DOF choice.</td>', 'Although in one sense I like the way you''ve caught two butterflies together, in another sense, the recognisable shape of a butterfly wing has been lost and I''m not sure that works for me... I do like the DOF choice.', '2003-07-30 13:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(370957, 30233, 9809, '<td valign="top">This would have been a much better shot if it hadn''t been a self portrait. You could have set up your tripod and fired remotely and made sure the camera was hidden by the butterfly on the globe. Even if the challenge is past, give it a try and see how you like it. Also, don''t crop off the left or top and make sure you get the tip of the angel''s wing in the shot. It seems unbalanced right now with the left and top cut off, but the stand underneath showing.</td>', 'This would have been a much better shot if it hadn''t been a self portrait. You could have set up your tripod and fired remotely and made sure the camera was hidden by the butterfly on the globe. Even if the challenge is past, give it a try and see how you like it. Also, don''t crop off the left or top and make sure you get the tip of the angel''s wing in the shot. It seems unbalanced right now with the left and top cut off, but the stand underneath showing.', '2003-07-30 13:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(370958, 31057, 10626, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of colors and light. The 3rds rule perfectly used. Congratulations!</td>', 'Very nice use of colors and light. The 3rds rule perfectly used. Congratulations!', '2003-07-30 13:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(370960, 31057, 3087, '<td valign="top">Summer days.... it''s hot here and this image really makes me _feel_ the heat of sitting out in a pleasant green garden or park.</td>', 'Summer days.... it''s hot here and this image really makes me _feel_ the heat of sitting out in a pleasant green garden or park.', '2003-07-30 13:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(370961, 30170, 10219, '<td valign="top">Should have given us a title, to help a bit.  WIth such a specific challenge, I can''t tell if this is in a garden or not, has anything to do with a garden or not...  Not that I cannot appreciate abstract, this is just VERY ABSTRACT due to the macro. 5</td>', 'Should have given us a title, to help a bit.  WIth such a specific challenge, I can''t tell if this is in a garden or not, has anything to do with a garden or not...  Not that I cannot appreciate abstract, this is just VERY ABSTRACT due to the macro. 5', '2003-07-30 13:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
