(370963, 30581, 10219, '<td valign="top">Great LINES, great contrast, great focus, challenge affiliation is okay - 7</td>', 'Great LINES, great contrast, great focus, challenge affiliation is okay - 7', '2003-07-30 13:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(370966, 30991, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice subject material. I can see how the vertical lines are true to the edge of the frame on the right but this means they are quite a lot out on the left. I wonder if it would be better to rotate a touch so that the central area of the fence and the spade handles are perfectly vertical. Great feeling of a day''s work in the garden... not that you''d catch me doing it! :)</td>', 'Nice subject material. I can see how the vertical lines are true to the edge of the frame on the right but this means they are quite a lot out on the left. I wonder if it would be better to rotate a touch so that the central area of the fence and the spade handles are perfectly vertical. Great feeling of a day''s work in the garden... not that you''d catch me doing it! :)', '2003-07-30 13:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
