(371059, 31093, 3087, '<td valign="top">Ooooh another pair of bugs... Again - the sheen and colours are beautifully captured. Perhaps a little too much in shadow but the composition, with the main lead on a diagonal right across the frame, is excellent.</td>', 'Ooooh another pair of bugs... Again - the sheen and colours are beautifully captured. Perhaps a little too much in shadow but the composition, with the main lead on a diagonal right across the frame, is excellent.', '2003-07-30 13:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
