(371071, 30581, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous abstract pattern formed from clearly recognisable garden contents. I love it! The diagonals are striking and I love the colours of the variegated leaves.</td>', 'This is a fabulous abstract pattern formed from clearly recognisable garden contents. I love it! The diagonals are striking and I love the colours of the variegated leaves.', '2003-07-30 13:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
