(371470, 31054, 10328, '<td valign="top">Kinda blurry. Never seen a leaf spider so wasn''t sure - is it the shiny thing in the top/right?</td>', 'Kinda blurry. Never seen a leaf spider so wasn''t sure - is it the shiny thing in the top/right?', '2003-07-30 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(371471, 31093, 10328, '<td valign="top">''Come on and take a free ride, yeah yeah yeah yeah..." :) Very sharp. I like it.</td>', '''Come on and take a free ride, yeah yeah yeah yeah..." :) Very sharp. I like it.', '2003-07-30 18:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(371473, 30954, 10328, '<td valign="top">Kinda bad lighting. May wish to try to move closer to your subjects and work on the focus a little.</td>', 'Kinda bad lighting. May wish to try to move closer to your subjects and work on the focus a little.', '2003-07-30 18:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(371474, 31205, 10328, '<td valign="top">Ahh. I have never, ever, everever seen a wasp drink. Thank you!</td>', 'Ahh. I have never, ever, everever seen a wasp drink. Thank you!', '2003-07-30 18:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(371476, 30592, 7778, '<td valign="top">This is, really, a wonderful photo, revealing only what is essential, and that beautifully, but...<br/> <br/>I wish the spider appeared much bigger (!) and bolder. It''s also a lil too centered within the frame, to my taste.</td>', 'This is, really, a wonderful photo, revealing only what is essential, and that beautifully, but... I wish the spider appeared much bigger (!) and bolder. It''s also a lil too centered within the frame, to my taste.', '2003-07-30 18:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(371477, 30979, 10328, '<td valign="top">Good title.</td>', 'Good title.', '2003-07-30 18:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(371479, 31220, 10328, '<td valign="top">Good color and lighting and choice of subject.</td>', 'Good color and lighting and choice of subject.', '2003-07-30 18:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(371480, 30491, 10328, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Sharp focus.</td>', 'Excellent. Sharp focus.', '2003-07-30 18:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(371483, 30689, 9809, '<td valign="top">A little deeper DOF would be better.</td>', 'A little deeper DOF would be better.', '2003-07-30 18:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(371484, 30883, 10328, '<td valign="top">Good light and shadow. Did well.</td>', 'Good light and shadow. Did well.', '2003-07-30 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(371486, 30717, 10328, '<td valign="top">Really like these rich colors.</td>', 'Really like these rich colors.', '2003-07-30 18:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(371487, 30933, 10328, '<td valign="top">Wow. Excellent focus. They''re amazing yet kindof ugly aren''t they?</td>', 'Wow. Excellent focus. They''re amazing yet kindof ugly aren''t they?', '2003-07-30 18:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(371489, 30622, 10328, '<td valign="top">Fred kindof matches his environs.</td>', 'Fred kindof matches his environs.', '2003-07-30 18:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(371491, 30112, 10328, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!</td>', 'Nice catch!', '2003-07-30 18:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(371492, 30231, 10328, '<td valign="top">YECHH... quick cursory glances... looks in-focus... nice contrast... good use of lighting...</td>', 'YECHH... quick cursory glances... looks in-focus... nice contrast... good use of lighting...', '2003-07-30 18:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(371494, 30171, 10328, '<td valign="top">Frame it!</td>', 'Frame it!', '2003-07-30 18:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(371495, 30175, 7778, '<td valign="top">Sharp, decent tonality retained in the b &amp; w, a mode very apt for an emphasis on these variegate forms. Perspective and depth, particularly, are made to be ''felt''.<br/> <br/>There points of slight overexposure here and there. Negligible, given the range of greys.</td>', 'Sharp, decent tonality retained in the b & w, a mode very apt for an emphasis on these variegate forms. Perspective and depth, particularly, are made to be ''felt''. There points of slight overexposure here and there. Negligible, given the range of greys.', '2003-07-30 18:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(371497, 31141, 10328, '<td valign="top">Truly a wonder. Excellent focus.</td>', 'Truly a wonder. Excellent focus.', '2003-07-30 18:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(371499, 31195, 6504, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very good photo.  The water drops add a lot to it.</td>', 'I think this is a very good photo.  The water drops add a lot to it.', '2003-07-30 18:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(371500, 31168, 9116, '<td valign="top">exceptional colorsceme and composition, would be perfect without the dwarf.  The dwarf makes it humorous, attracts the eye and drops it right into the subject. Compliments.</td>', 'exceptional colorsceme and composition, would be perfect without the dwarf.  The dwarf makes it humorous, attracts the eye and drops it right into the subject. Compliments.', '2003-07-30 18:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(371501, 30676, 6504, '<td valign="top">You have taken a very ugly critter and made a beautiful photo with it.<br/>You''re the winner in my opinion.</td>', 'You have taken a very ugly critter and made a beautiful photo with it.You''re the winner in my opinion.', '2003-07-30 18:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(371504, 30847, 7778, '<td valign="top">Quite remarkable tonal pleasures in this capture, apparently due to post-processing. A lil too dark to retain any luminosity, perhaps.</td>', 'Quite remarkable tonal pleasures in this capture, apparently due to post-processing. A lil too dark to retain any luminosity, perhaps.', '2003-07-30 18:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(371505, 31123, 6504, '<td valign="top">I like your garden fried a lot.  You got a nice clear,sharp picture of him (her).<br/>The colors are very good.</td>', 'I like your garden fried a lot.  You got a nice clear,sharp picture of him (her).The colors are very good.', '2003-07-30 18:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(371507, 30939, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a challenge.  You did well to get this close.  More DOF  would probably give it more impact.  Only the side of the bug closest to the camera is in focus.  One tip that  a few ''professional'' photographers have given me is to focus on the eye(s).  In this case the eye is slightly behind the area in focus.<br/> <br/>For composition more room on the right would give this critter space to move into.</td>', 'This is definitely a challenge.  You did well to get this close.  More DOF  would probably give it more impact.  Only the side of the bug closest to the camera is in focus.  One tip that  a few ''professional'' photographers have given me is to focus on the eye(s).  In this case the eye is slightly behind the area in focus. For composition more room on the right would give this critter space to move into.', '2003-07-30 18:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(371509, 30972, 6504, '<td valign="top">GOOD!!!   It could be just a tiny bit more sharp, and it would be in first place.<br/>Take a look at the snail picture, and imagine if this were as sharp how great it would be.</td>', 'GOOD!!!   It could be just a tiny bit more sharp, and it would be in first place.Take a look at the snail picture, and imagine if this were as sharp how great it would be.', '2003-07-30 18:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(371510, 30717, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and sharp.  I especially like the sharp cut of the tomato.  Excellent photo.  Did theyt really come from your garden?   If so, lucky you!</td>', 'Very colorful and sharp.  I especially like the sharp cut of the tomato.  Excellent photo.  Did theyt really come from your garden?   If so, lucky you!', '2003-07-30 18:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(371512, 30356, 6504, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, I can relate!  Great picture.  Thanks for the chuckle.</td>', 'Oh yes, I can relate!  Great picture.  Thanks for the chuckle.', '2003-07-30 18:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(371513, 30918, 7743, '<td valign="top">The horizon is straight and there''s structure in the line of pots but there''s too many center''s of interest.  One suggestion would be to pick one item  to be your main focus but still include the rest and use a shallower DOF to isolate the chosen item.</td>', 'The horizon is straight and there''s structure in the line of pots but there''s too many center''s of interest.  One suggestion would be to pick one item  to be your main focus but still include the rest and use a shallower DOF to isolate the chosen item.', '2003-07-30 18:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(371514, 31148, 6504, '<td valign="top">Good and simple.  Beautiful colors, good clarity.  But couldn''t you have put at least a little flower in the box???    Good picture.</td>', 'Good and simple.  Beautiful colors, good clarity.  But couldn''t you have put at least a little flower in the box???    Good picture.', '2003-07-30 18:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(371515, 30949, 10240, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, not crazy about the out of focus berries in the front</td>', 'Nice photo, not crazy about the out of focus berries in the front', '2003-07-30 18:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(371517, 30267, 6504, '<td valign="top">A little more light would have helped this picture, technically speaking.<br/>It''s a great photo, though.   I want to know if he made it or not.</td>', 'A little more light would have helped this picture, technically speaking.It''s a great photo, though.   I want to know if he made it or not.', '2003-07-30 18:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(371518, 30994, 10328, '<td valign="top">Is this a ... bee?</td>', 'Is this a ... bee?', '2003-07-30 18:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(371519, 30676, 10240, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and contrasting textures.  Very nice. 9</td>', 'Nice composition and contrasting textures.  Very nice. 9', '2003-07-30 18:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(371520, 31115, 10328, '<td valign="top">That''s a great angle.</td>', 'That''s a great angle.', '2003-07-30 18:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(371521, 30175, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good choice of black and white.  The contrast is good.  The impact here I believe is from the verticle lines created by the leaves.  Did you try this image in the vertical format to emphasize this?</td>', 'Good choice of black and white.  The contrast is good.  The impact here I believe is from the verticle lines created by the leaves.  Did you try this image in the vertical format to emphasize this?', '2003-07-30 18:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(371522, 30908, 10240, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2003-07-30 18:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(371525, 30516, 6504, '<td valign="top">Good Picture!!  I like the sunlight on the plants and the goat is almost saying ...oops, I''m in trouble now.</td>', 'Good Picture!!  I like the sunlight on the plants and the goat is almost saying ...oops, I''m in trouble now.', '2003-07-30 18:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(371526, 30251, 10328, '<td valign="top">These are a find. Good job capturing it.</td>', 'These are a find. Good job capturing it.', '2003-07-30 18:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(371529, 30345, 10328, '<td valign="top">Out of focus/uncentered.</td>', 'Out of focus/uncentered.', '2003-07-30 18:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(371531, 31218, 6504, '<td valign="top">You picked the right time of day for this.  Beautiful glow to the picture.  I like the color of the old wheel barrow against the green plants.  The texture of the straw adds to it.   All over a very good photo for the challenge.</td>', 'You picked the right time of day for this.  Beautiful glow to the picture.  I like the color of the old wheel barrow against the green plants.  The texture of the straw adds to it.   All over a very good photo for the challenge.', '2003-07-30 18:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(371532, 30539, 10328, '<td valign="top">It looks real. Excellent work.</td>', 'It looks real. Excellent work.', '2003-07-30 18:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(371533, 30703, 10240, '<td valign="top">Very original idea, lighting looks to be from an on camera flash(corners are a little dark), probably would have helped to have more ambiant light. 7</td>', 'Very original idea, lighting looks to be from an on camera flash(corners are a little dark), probably would have helped to have more ambiant light. 7', '2003-07-30 18:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(371534, 30369, 10328, '<td valign="top">Hehe.</td>', 'Hehe.', '2003-07-30 18:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
