(371536, 31150, 7743, '<td valign="top">This gives a nice tranquille, inviting and cosy feel.    Losing some of the trees on the right would probably increase this effect.  All that''s needed is a side table with an overturned paperback and a jug of  something cold.</td>', 'This gives a nice tranquille, inviting and cosy feel.    Losing some of the trees on the right would probably increase this effect.  All that''s needed is a side table with an overturned paperback and a jug of  something cold.', '2003-07-30 18:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
