(371697, 31145, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo has an interesting look to it because of the teehnique you chose.  I also believe that it''s probably borderline in this challenge since ''flowers'' are not supposed to be the main subject.   I think your composition would probably be stronger with ''3'' subjects rather than 4.</td>', 'This photo has an interesting look to it because of the teehnique you chose.  I also believe that it''s probably borderline in this challenge since ''flowers'' are not supposed to be the main subject.   I think your composition would probably be stronger with ''3'' subjects rather than 4.', '2003-07-30 21:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
