(372087, 30616, 7086, '<td valign="top">Good use of a natural frame and symmetry. The image needs to be rotated slightly clockwise.</td>', 'Good use of a natural frame and symmetry. The image needs to be rotated slightly clockwise.', '2003-07-31 04:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
