(372154, 31110, 10727, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. I loved the red tonge and the light. Nice details. Good luck. Congratulations!!!</td>', 'Beautiful photo. I loved the red tonge and the light. Nice details. Good luck. Congratulations!!!', '2003-07-31 07:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(372155, 31194, 4258, '<td valign="top">The sepia tone really works for this picture, hope you are not penalised by the Topic Police as not strictly adhereing and blah!!</td>', 'The sepia tone really works for this picture, hope you are not penalised by the Topic Police as not strictly adhereing and blah!!', '2003-07-31 08:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(372156, 30538, 10626, '<td valign="top">Try not to center the subject in your photo. Keep always in mind the 3rds rule.<br/>It''s a funny idea for a photo.  I like it :)  Good luck !</td>', 'Try not to center the subject in your photo. Keep always in mind the 3rds rule.It''s a funny idea for a photo.  I like it :)  Good luck !', '2003-07-31 08:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(372157, 30472, 10626, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Nice composition, colors and exposure. Congratulations. Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Nice composition, colors and exposure. Congratulations. Good luck.', '2003-07-31 08:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(372158, 31083, 917, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. This is a drone fly, it is not a bee. Focus/sharpness is fine, but composition seems a little off. On a technical note, species identification in alot of flies is done by looking at the veins on the wing, so use shade or a polarising filter to remove the glare.<br/>Edited to add the word not before ''a bee''<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-06 05:50:55.</i></td>', 'Nice pic. This is a drone fly, it is not a bee. Focus/sharpness is fine, but composition seems a little off. On a technical note, species identification in alot of flies is done by looking at the veins on the wing, so use shade or a polarising filter to remove the glare.Edited to add the word not before ''a bee''', '2003-07-31 08:09:07.000000', '2003-08-06 06:50:55.000000', 1),
(372161, 31098, 4258, '<td valign="top">Love the almost sepia tones, the depth and perspective, Do you have a composition which is vertical with very little of the bush/tree on left showing? [8]</td>', 'Love the almost sepia tones, the depth and perspective, Do you have a composition which is vertical with very little of the bush/tree on left showing? [8]', '2003-07-31 08:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(372163, 31128, 8274, '<td valign="top">I very much like this - it even looks like a snake</td>', 'I very much like this - it even looks like a snake', '2003-07-31 08:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(372164, 30428, 917, '<td valign="top">I feel the spade should be pointing into the pic. As it currently is, it leads the eye straight out of frame.</td>', 'I feel the spade should be pointing into the pic. As it currently is, it leads the eye straight out of frame.', '2003-07-31 08:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(372165, 30291, 9854, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to see at least one complete wing.</td>', 'Would have loved to see at least one complete wing.', '2003-07-31 08:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(372166, 31141, 9854, '<td valign="top">The moth looks as furry as the flower its on. Nice dof</td>', 'The moth looks as furry as the flower its on. Nice dof', '2003-07-31 08:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(372167, 31144, 9854, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this critter before, and I''ve always wondered whether it''s really a dragonfly because of how it holds its wings when at rest -this is sort of like misidentifying a moth as a butterfly... But that''s a digression. The blue is brilliant in this photo - though it gets a bit diluted by the light background. Still, a nice shot!</td>', 'I''ve seen this critter before, and I''ve always wondered whether it''s really a dragonfly because of how it holds its wings when at rest -this is sort of like misidentifying a moth as a butterfly... But that''s a digression. The blue is brilliant in this photo - though it gets a bit diluted by the light background. Still, a nice shot!', '2003-07-31 08:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(372169, 31033, 4258, '<td valign="top">Would be nice if it was bigger</td>', 'Would be nice if it was bigger', '2003-07-31 08:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(372171, 30945, 10370, '<td valign="top">Love it.  A bit too much Unsharp Mask possibly? However it does add a certain contrasty impact.</td>', 'Love it.  A bit too much Unsharp Mask possibly? However it does add a certain contrasty impact.', '2003-07-31 08:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(372172, 31246, 10370, '<td valign="top">Brilliant Macro - so crisp</td>', 'Brilliant Macro - so crisp', '2003-07-31 08:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(372173, 31115, 917, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, the way the bright area of sky keeps the attention in the middle of the frame is particularly good.</td>', 'Excellent composition, the way the bright area of sky keeps the attention in the middle of the frame is particularly good.', '2003-07-31 08:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(372174, 30539, 10370, '<td valign="top">Great DOF</td>', 'Great DOF', '2003-07-31 08:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(372175, 30886, 9854, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there once, and I really enjoyed what I saw. I miss seeing it in green, however.</td>', 'I''ve been there once, and I really enjoyed what I saw. I miss seeing it in green, however.', '2003-07-31 08:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(372176, 30491, 8522, '<td valign="top">My favourite this challenge. Superb saturation, great lighting, effective background. Nice dof. Interesting composition. Fits the challenge creatively. 10</td>', 'My favourite this challenge. Superb saturation, great lighting, effective background. Nice dof. Interesting composition. Fits the challenge creatively. 10', '2003-07-31 08:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(372177, 30491, 10370, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful.  Great black background contrasts well and I love the halo lighting around the holes</td>', 'absolutely beautiful.  Great black background contrasts well and I love the halo lighting around the holes', '2003-07-31 08:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(372178, 31227, 4258, '<td valign="top">I pricked my finger when I touched the screen - next time please post a warning ;) [8]</td>', 'I pricked my finger when I touched the screen - next time please post a warning ;) [8]', '2003-07-31 08:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(372179, 31144, 917, '<td valign="top">Background is a problem, not sure how you''d fix it though.</td>', 'Background is a problem, not sure how you''d fix it though.', '2003-07-31 08:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(372180, 30593, 8522, '<td valign="top">The best insect macro this challenge. I really wish I hadn''t entered one now! What sets this one above the rest is the composition and background. No distracting elements, the simplicity works very well. The dof is spot-on, very nice clarity in your subject. You bring out the character of your grasshopper well. Nice colours. Effective lighting and exposure. 10</td>', 'The best insect macro this challenge. I really wish I hadn''t entered one now! What sets this one above the rest is the composition and background. No distracting elements, the simplicity works very well. The dof is spot-on, very nice clarity in your subject. You bring out the character of your grasshopper well. Nice colours. Effective lighting and exposure. 10', '2003-07-31 08:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(372181, 30572, 4258, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition - do you have one which has the bamboos in the foreground in focus as well? Would like to compare ...</td>', 'Very nice composition - do you have one which has the bamboos in the foreground in focus as well? Would like to compare ...', '2003-07-31 08:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(372182, 30874, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nicely cropped, effective blend of colours. Impressive dof... background is nicely blurred, ALL of the flower is fairly sharp! Interesting textures, quite delicate in feel which fits with your subject. 9</td>', 'Nicely cropped, effective blend of colours. Impressive dof... background is nicely blurred, ALL of the flower is fairly sharp! Interesting textures, quite delicate in feel which fits with your subject. 9', '2003-07-31 08:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(372184, 31002, 10370, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really meet the challenge and is poorly cropped and exposed</td>', 'Doesn''t really meet the challenge and is poorly cropped and exposed', '2003-07-31 08:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(372185, 30634, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure that such extremely shallow DOF serves this shot well - though it gives god depth to the image itself, it''s just a bit much.</td>', 'Not sure that such extremely shallow DOF serves this shot well - though it gives god depth to the image itself, it''s just a bit much.', '2003-07-31 08:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(372186, 31110, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice butterfly shot. I feel that the composition lets it down a little... the eyes are the focus for me and they are too centred in the frame for my liking. I''m also not sure about the proportion of bark in the shot. Other than that, brilliant! I really love the proboscis, that''s what makes this shot so effective. Nice dappled background, although I''m not sure there is enough contrast between this and the subject. 9</td>', 'Very nice butterfly shot. I feel that the composition lets it down a little... the eyes are the focus for me and they are too centred in the frame for my liking. I''m also not sure about the proportion of bark in the shot. Other than that, brilliant! I really love the proboscis, that''s what makes this shot so effective. Nice dappled background, although I''m not sure there is enough contrast between this and the subject. 9', '2003-07-31 08:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(372187, 31246, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow! Love the eyes and antennae. The dominance of yellow in the shot is very effective. I''d have liked just a little more dof on the bee while keeping the flower blurred. Not entirely sure about the just-off-centre placement, I''d have liked it more off centre. 9</td>', 'Wow! Love the eyes and antennae. The dominance of yellow in the shot is very effective. I''d have liked just a little more dof on the bee while keeping the flower blurred. Not entirely sure about the just-off-centre placement, I''d have liked it more off centre. 9', '2003-07-31 08:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(372189, 30268, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Hef!...Tooooooooooo many flowers, and really flowers on the negligé? The model is posed nicely and very pretty, but perhaps a bit to centered.</td>', 'Great shot, Hef!...Tooooooooooo many flowers, and really flowers on the negligé? The model is posed nicely and very pretty, but perhaps a bit to centered.', '2003-07-31 08:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
