(372192, 30558, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... perhaps just a tad overexposed. Shame the dof didn''t extend to the rear of your subject. Perhaps a little more saturation as well would have been good. Very effective insect macro though, nicely blurred background. 9</td>', 'Nice shot... perhaps just a tad overexposed. Shame the dof didn''t extend to the rear of your subject. Perhaps a little more saturation as well would have been good. Very effective insect macro though, nicely blurred background. 9', '2003-07-31 08:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
