(372210, 30613, 6999, '<td valign="top">After quite a bit of beer, presumably. Kind of like the colours, kind o like the sense of movement, but it looks like an accidental shot that kind of fitted the challenge: a couple of giveaways - no apparent cropping, and the blurred figures head being cut-off, and all of a sudden it starts to look throughly pointless to me. Sorry.</td>', 'After quite a bit of beer, presumably. Kind of like the colours, kind o like the sense of movement, but it looks like an accidental shot that kind of fitted the challenge: a couple of giveaways - no apparent cropping, and the blurred figures head being cut-off, and all of a sudden it starts to look throughly pointless to me. Sorry.', '2003-07-31 09:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
