(372216, 31147, 5728, '<td valign="top">A wonderful B&amp;W photo. Although I wouldn''t have cropped the plant half out like you have, I would have rather left it in the pic fully to enhance the "garden" feeling, but still a 10!</td>', 'A wonderful B&W photo. Although I wouldn''t have cropped the plant half out like you have, I would have rather left it in the pic fully to enhance the "garden" feeling, but still a 10!', '2003-07-31 09:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
