(372299, 30556, 8522, '<td valign="top">Fascinating picture... not quite sure about your composition, but great exploration of light and shade. I love the face! Effective use of black and white. 8</td>', 'Fascinating picture... not quite sure about your composition, but great exploration of light and shade. I love the face! Effective use of black and white. 8', '2003-07-31 10:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(372300, 30416, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.</td>', 'Nice framing.', '2003-07-31 10:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(372301, 31088, 10441, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, should be a highly rated shot!</td>', 'Cute picture, should be a highly rated shot!', '2003-07-31 10:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(372302, 30599, 10441, '<td valign="top">Beauty! Nicely composed.</td>', 'Beauty! Nicely composed.', '2003-07-31 10:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(372303, 30526, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice use of thirds.</td>', 'Nice use of thirds.', '2003-07-31 10:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(372304, 30520, 8522, '<td valign="top">Subject too centred in the frame for my taste, otherwise great composition. I love how the eye is drawn in to the girl by the wooden ''spokes''. Great portrait. Perhaps if she was off centre and if you''d made more of the foreground leaves this could have been improved. 8</td>', 'Subject too centred in the frame for my taste, otherwise great composition. I love how the eye is drawn in to the girl by the wooden ''spokes''. Great portrait. Perhaps if she was off centre and if you''d made more of the foreground leaves this could have been improved. 8', '2003-07-31 10:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(372305, 30925, 10441, '<td valign="top">Well composed macro.</td>', 'Well composed macro.', '2003-07-31 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(372306, 31144, 10739, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Good composition and excellent execution.</td>', 'Great picture. Good composition and excellent execution.', '2003-07-31 10:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(372307, 31238, 3569, '<td valign="top">a bit to dark to see good details.</td>', 'a bit to dark to see good details.', '2003-07-31 10:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(372309, 30894, 10441, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective, use of framing.  If the depth of field were deeper, this would have been a 10.</td>', 'Cool perspective, use of framing.  If the depth of field were deeper, this would have been a 10.', '2003-07-31 10:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(372310, 30348, 3569, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I am supposed to see, so hard to vote on.</td>', 'Not sure what I am supposed to see, so hard to vote on.', '2003-07-31 10:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(372312, 30515, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, communicates mood very well. Interesting lighting and exploration of textures. Good sharpness. Don''t care for your border. 8</td>', 'Great shot, communicates mood very well. Interesting lighting and exploration of textures. Good sharpness. Don''t care for your border. 8', '2003-07-31 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(372313, 30809, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the composition.</td>', 'Nice job with the composition.', '2003-07-31 10:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(372314, 30784, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit off on fucus, nice set-up though.</td>', 'A bit off on fucus, nice set-up though.', '2003-07-31 10:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(372319, 30424, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit mot DOF and this would have been a winner.  I like the shoot.</td>', 'A bit mot DOF and this would have been a winner.  I like the shoot.', '2003-07-31 10:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(372320, 31186, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, I like the way the frame is broken up into 3 elements. The orange and green contrast nicely. Shame it isn''t sharper. 8</td>', 'Interesting composition, I like the way the frame is broken up into 3 elements. The orange and green contrast nicely. Shame it isn''t sharper. 8', '2003-07-31 10:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(372322, 30631, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.</td>', 'Nice macro.', '2003-07-31 10:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(372323, 30193, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Well composed.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Well composed.', '2003-07-31 10:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(372325, 31009, 3569, '<td valign="top">To me, the cropping is to close.  I''d like a little habitat with the catepillar.</td>', 'To me, the cropping is to close.  I''d like a little habitat with the catepillar.', '2003-07-31 10:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(372327, 31077, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a bit of offset may have made the photo even better.</td>', 'Nice shot, a bit of offset may have made the photo even better.', '2003-07-31 10:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(372328, 30491, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.', '2003-07-31 10:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(372330, 30994, 8522, '<td valign="top">Impressive macro... I''d have prefered to see the front of this insect though. The chains are great, but the rest of your background doesn''t work so well. Shame that your shot didn''t include all of his right wing. 8</td>', 'Impressive macro... I''d have prefered to see the front of this insect though. The chains are great, but the rest of your background doesn''t work so well. Shame that your shot didn''t include all of his right wing. 8', '2003-07-31 10:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(372331, 30943, 3569, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts of the insect and green leaves, nice shot.</td>', 'I like the contrasts of the insect and green leaves, nice shot.', '2003-07-31 10:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(372333, 30629, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the sky looks a bit washed, but otherwise it''s a beauty.</td>', 'Nice shot, the sky looks a bit washed, but otherwise it''s a beauty.', '2003-07-31 10:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(372334, 30751, 3569, '<td valign="top">Very southwestern looking, good job.</td>', 'Very southwestern looking, good job.', '2003-07-31 10:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(372335, 31115, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love the concept, but unfortunately there isn''t quite enough to hold my interest. I love the green you''ve captured in the clothes line. Perhaps with a more dramatic sky this could have been improved... or perhaps rain! 8</td>', 'I love the concept, but unfortunately there isn''t quite enough to hold my interest. I love the green you''ve captured in the clothes line. Perhaps with a more dramatic sky this could have been improved... or perhaps rain! 8', '2003-07-31 10:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(372336, 30285, 10739, '<td valign="top">I think the picture would be more impactant with higher depth of field</td>', 'I think the picture would be more impactant with higher depth of field', '2003-07-31 10:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(372338, 30957, 10739, '<td valign="top">May be it could improve with another rotation angle</td>', 'May be it could improve with another rotation angle', '2003-07-31 10:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(372341, 31014, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured textures. I love the lighting and the exposure. Not quite sure about the composition though. Doesn''t quite seem to balance to me... 8</td>', 'Beautifully captured textures. I love the lighting and the exposure. Not quite sure about the composition though. Doesn''t quite seem to balance to me... 8', '2003-07-31 10:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(372342, 31195, 10739, '<td valign="top">I miss more vivid colors and it''s a bit misscentered but nice composition</td>', 'I miss more vivid colors and it''s a bit misscentered but nice composition', '2003-07-31 11:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(372345, 30142, 10739, '<td valign="top">Looks to be a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Looks to be a bit out of focus.', '2003-07-31 11:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(372346, 30270, 10739, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2003-07-31 11:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(372347, 31051, 10739, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2003-07-31 11:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(372349, 30634, 10739, '<td valign="top">a bit more</td>', 'a bit more', '2003-07-31 11:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(372350, 30233, 10739, '<td valign="top">may be the title should be "self portrait" ? ;)</td>', 'may be the title should be "self portrait" ? ;)', '2003-07-31 11:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(372352, 30949, 10739, '<td valign="top">the parts are of focus distract too much in my opinion</td>', 'the parts are of focus distract too much in my opinion', '2003-07-31 11:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(372353, 31150, 9986, '<td valign="top">Good photo..nice composition. Maybe the left leaves could have been left out or better focussed...</td>', 'Good photo..nice composition. Maybe the left leaves could have been left out or better focussed...', '2003-07-31 11:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(372355, 30874, 9763, '<td valign="top">Excellent Photo all around.  I love how the light shines through the wings too!</td>', 'Excellent Photo all around.  I love how the light shines through the wings too!', '2003-07-31 11:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(372357, 31000, 10739, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, although a bit out of the challenge</td>', 'Very nice picture, although a bit out of the challenge', '2003-07-31 11:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(372361, 31243, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures, nice range of tones captured here. I''d have liked it a tad sharper. The tree is a bit too centred for my taste. 8</td>', 'Beautiful textures, nice range of tones captured here. I''d have liked it a tad sharper. The tree is a bit too centred for my taste. 8', '2003-07-31 11:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(372363, 31018, 9819, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, good play with the focus and the color, the winner for me.</td>', 'Excellent shot, good play with the focus and the color, the winner for me.', '2003-07-31 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(372364, 30879, 8522, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous lighting. Great exploration of light and shadow. Love the coins at the bottom of the water. Something about the composition doesn''t do it for me, but I can''t quite put my finger on it. Perhaps the ratio of leaves to water isn''t quite right... 8</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous lighting. Great exploration of light and shadow. Love the coins at the bottom of the water. Something about the composition doesn''t do it for me, but I can''t quite put my finger on it. Perhaps the ratio of leaves to water isn''t quite right... 8', '2003-07-31 11:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(372365, 30420, 9819, '<td valign="top">Perdoneme, no puedo ser objetivo, es que me gusta mucho quien tomo la foto !!!!</td>', 'Perdoneme, no puedo ser objetivo, es que me gusta mucho quien tomo la foto !!!!', '2003-07-31 11:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(372366, 30908, 9819, '<td valign="top">it''s really nice, one of my favorites !!!!</td>', 'it''s really nice, one of my favorites !!!!', '2003-07-31 11:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(372367, 31225, 9819, '<td valign="top">Nice colors...</td>', 'Nice colors...', '2003-07-31 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(372368, 30653, 9819, '<td valign="top">simple, but nice colors....excellent shot</td>', 'simple, but nice colors....excellent shot', '2003-07-31 11:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(372369, 30161, 9819, '<td valign="top">Nice girl, nice composition, nice colors....but what about the garden?</td>', 'Nice girl, nice composition, nice colors....but what about the garden?', '2003-07-31 11:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(372370, 30266, 9819, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but what about the garden?</td>', 'I like the concept, but what about the garden?', '2003-07-31 11:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(372371, 30303, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture... perhaps a little too almost-symmetrical for me. I don''t care for your heavy border which is too distracting. Lovely, delicate colours with perfect saturation. The crop is a little tight for my taste here. 8</td>', 'Beautiful capture... perhaps a little too almost-symmetrical for me. I don''t care for your heavy border which is too distracting. Lovely, delicate colours with perfect saturation. The crop is a little tight for my taste here. 8', '2003-07-31 11:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(372373, 30694, 9819, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the idea, neither the colors nor the out of focus effect....</td>', 'I don''t like the idea, neither the colors nor the out of focus effect....', '2003-07-31 11:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(372374, 30933, 8522, '<td valign="top">Stunning, I love the purple tones in this picture. Very effective dof. Shame you cut off the tip of the right wing. Perhaps could benefit with a touch of sharpening. 8</td>', 'Stunning, I love the purple tones in this picture. Very effective dof. Shame you cut off the tip of the right wing. Perhaps could benefit with a touch of sharpening. 8', '2003-07-31 11:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(372377, 30369, 9819, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the subject it''s awful</td>', 'I like the concept, but the subject it''s awful', '2003-07-31 11:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(372378, 30736, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great composition, shame about the glare on your insect. Very nice background... perhaps not enough contrast in colour between the top left and the subject. Nice use of dof. 8</td>', 'Great composition, shame about the glare on your insect. Very nice background... perhaps not enough contrast in colour between the top left and the subject. Nice use of dof. 8', '2003-07-31 11:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(372380, 30615, 9819, '<td valign="top">Good water campaign, but what about the garden?</td>', 'Good water campaign, but what about the garden?', '2003-07-31 11:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(372381, 30534, 8522, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit oversharpened for some people''s taste, but I like the interesting effect that has been produced here. I think it could have benefited from some gamma adjustment however... and I feel that the highlights are a bit burnt out. I like the composition. 8</td>', 'Perhaps a bit oversharpened for some people''s taste, but I like the interesting effect that has been produced here. I think it could have benefited from some gamma adjustment however... and I feel that the highlights are a bit burnt out. I like the composition. 8', '2003-07-31 11:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(372382, 30416, 9819, '<td valign="top">Why did you select this subject, it''s awfull</td>', 'Why did you select this subject, it''s awfull', '2003-07-31 11:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(372386, 30994, 9819, '<td valign="top">Why did you select this subject, it''s awfull</td>', 'Why did you select this subject, it''s awfull', '2003-07-31 11:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(372387, 31141, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture, nice combination of colours. Your background is very effective. Excellent detail in the butterfly/ moth, I particularly like the eye. Great textures. 8</td>', 'Lovely capture, nice combination of colours. Your background is very effective. Excellent detail in the butterfly/ moth, I particularly like the eye. Great textures. 8', '2003-07-31 11:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(372388, 31115, 9819, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the message, what happend with the garden?</td>', 'I don''t understand the message, what happend with the garden?', '2003-07-31 11:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(372389, 31219, 9819, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, I love the subject and the light</td>', 'Excellent shot, I love the subject and the light', '2003-07-31 11:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(372392, 30873, 9819, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, really amazing, suspended in the time</td>', 'Excellent shot, really amazing, suspended in the time', '2003-07-31 11:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(372393, 31027, 4338, '<td valign="top">i feel that taking this shot from the "water bearer" on the left looking right would have looked a bit nicer, instead of looking right to left. Also the image is pretty small</td>', 'i feel that taking this shot from the "water bearer" on the left looking right would have looked a bit nicer, instead of looking right to left. Also the image is pretty small', '2003-07-31 11:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(372394, 31203, 9819, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, one of my favorites !!!!</td>', 'Excellent shot, one of my favorites !!!!', '2003-07-31 11:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(372395, 31177, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very simple composition that works well, beautiful colours. The background seems a little noisy/ pixellated... does it need NeatImage, or was it caused by NeatImage? Not quite sure about the lighting on the caterpillar... having looked at the other entries, it would seem these are tricky things to light! It''s the shadow here that detracts for me... perhaps some way of diffusing the light on the subject would have been helpful. The water drops are a nice touch 8</td>', 'Very simple composition that works well, beautiful colours. The background seems a little noisy/ pixellated... does it need NeatImage, or was it caused by NeatImage? Not quite sure about the lighting on the caterpillar... having looked at the other entries, it would seem these are tricky things to light! It''s the shadow here that detracts for me... perhaps some way of diffusing the light on the subject would have been helpful. The water drops are a nice touch 8', '2003-07-31 11:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(372396, 31191, 4338, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but Im not to thrilled with the border, maybe just the border line would have been better with out the shading in the border, or lighter shading</td>', 'nice shot, but Im not to thrilled with the border, maybe just the border line would have been better with out the shading in the border, or lighter shading', '2003-07-31 11:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(372398, 30908, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... I love the shafts of light. I wonder if this is a conventional landscape which has had curves and colour adjustments, or a shot taken from the side of a fish tank? Very effective. 8</td>', 'Beautiful... I love the shafts of light. I wonder if this is a conventional landscape which has had curves and colour adjustments, or a shot taken from the side of a fish tank? Very effective. 8', '2003-07-31 11:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(372399, 30429, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great colours, good composition. Shame the picture is so small... next time, try to get the longest side at least 600 pixels long. Could have done with a tad more sharpening. 8</td>', 'Great colours, good composition. Shame the picture is so small... next time, try to get the longest side at least 600 pixels long. Could have done with a tad more sharpening. 8', '2003-07-31 11:35:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(372400, 30925, 4338, '<td valign="top">nice DOF.....</td>', 'nice DOF.....', '2003-07-31 11:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(372401, 30161, 8522, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look very diva-like... more a little afraid of speaking her mind. Nice shot though, black and white is very effective here. The background complements the subject well. 8</td>', 'She doesn''t look very diva-like... more a little afraid of speaking her mind. Nice shot though, black and white is very effective here. The background complements the subject well. 8', '2003-07-31 11:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(372403, 31218, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, I suspect you caught this at sunset. Some beautiful colours captured here. Not quite sure about the composition... it seems a bit wishy-washy to me. The colour of the wheelbarrow contrasts nicely with the foliage. 8</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, I suspect you caught this at sunset. Some beautiful colours captured here. Not quite sure about the composition... it seems a bit wishy-washy to me. The colour of the wheelbarrow contrasts nicely with the foliage. 8', '2003-07-31 11:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(372406, 30356, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a woman with a mission! Love the pose, almost like a Soviet propaganda poster! Black and white works well here, some nice textures captured, especially in the background. Her light coloured clothes contrast well with the background. 8</td>', 'Wow, this is a woman with a mission! Love the pose, almost like a Soviet propaganda poster! Black and white works well here, some nice textures captured, especially in the background. Her light coloured clothes contrast well with the background. 8', '2003-07-31 11:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(372407, 30683, 10240, '<td valign="top">My favorite gnome picture of the challenge, good focus, nice composition, I really like it. 10</td>', 'My favorite gnome picture of the challenge, good focus, nice composition, I really like it. 10', '2003-07-31 11:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(372408, 30892, 10240, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea and the photo.  I think the mirror looks a little tilted, (for the drivers use I''m sure), but still think it would look better straight.  9</td>', 'I really like the idea and the photo.  I think the mirror looks a little tilted, (for the drivers use I''m sure), but still think it would look better straight.  9', '2003-07-31 11:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(372409, 31057, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great picture, for once I like the effect of that flare filter that gives the sun six strands. Presumably you used fill-in flash for the leaves... I think it was a little on the harsh side. There''s quite a lot of noise in the background, especially in the top-left.  Nice composition. 8</td>', 'Great picture, for once I like the effect of that flare filter that gives the sun six strands. Presumably you used fill-in flash for the leaves... I think it was a little on the harsh side. There''s quite a lot of noise in the background, especially in the top-left.  Nice composition. 8', '2003-07-31 11:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(372410, 31203, 10240, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus and the framing, I wish it had a more contrasting color somewhere.  9</td>', 'I like the soft focus and the framing, I wish it had a more contrasting color somewhere.  9', '2003-07-31 11:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(372411, 30524, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, I think you could have sharpened this picture a bit though. The composition is a bit messy, there''s too much going on that distracts from the subject. The lighting doesn''t seem quite right... there''s too much glare on the side of the grasshopper. Well done for getting that close though! 8</td>', 'Nice macro, I think you could have sharpened this picture a bit though. The composition is a bit messy, there''s too much going on that distracts from the subject. The lighting doesn''t seem quite right... there''s too much glare on the side of the grasshopper. Well done for getting that close though! 8', '2003-07-31 11:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(372412, 30534, 10240, '<td valign="top">Contrast seems a little strong, maybe intentional?  Either way I like it.</td>', 'Contrast seems a little strong, maybe intentional?  Either way I like it.', '2003-07-31 11:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(372413, 30233, 10240, '<td valign="top">Kool, nice job on the sky reflection, and keeping everything level.  I really like that you included the angel on the right and didn''t just make it a picture of the globe. 9</td>', 'Kool, nice job on the sky reflection, and keeping everything level.  I really like that you included the angel on the right and didn''t just make it a picture of the globe. 9', '2003-07-31 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(372416, 30870, 10240, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Focus is very sharp(pun intended).  9</td>', 'Ouch!  Focus is very sharp(pun intended).  9', '2003-07-31 11:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(372417, 30676, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice macro, the detail on the snail comes over well.</td>', 'Choice macro, the detail on the snail comes over well.', '2003-07-31 12:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(372419, 30247, 5728, '<td valign="top">A different take on the challenge, but a good idea. Very suitable title!</td>', 'A different take on the challenge, but a good idea. Very suitable title!', '2003-07-31 12:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(372420, 31217, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good shot, interesting perspective. The title is fitting.</td>', 'Good shot, interesting perspective. The title is fitting.', '2003-07-31 12:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(372422, 30857, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thanx for the laugh :-) Very original.</td>', 'Thanx for the laugh :-) Very original.', '2003-07-31 12:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(372423, 30424, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture!! Funny title too. I only wish you hadn''t cropped the leg off the bug on top.</td>', 'Good capture!! Funny title too. I only wish you hadn''t cropped the leg off the bug on top.', '2003-07-31 12:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(372426, 30459, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good find :-) Maybe you shouldn''t have cropped out the flowers completely in the lower right hand corner. The only thing I really find out of place in this pic. The rest is good.</td>', 'Good find :-) Maybe you shouldn''t have cropped out the flowers completely in the lower right hand corner. The only thing I really find out of place in this pic. The rest is good.', '2003-07-31 12:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(372429, 31001, 9292, '<td valign="top">Amazing trees!</td>', 'Amazing trees!', '2003-07-31 12:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(372431, 30751, 9292, '<td valign="top">I prefer sunset, the light is softer. good composiiton</td>', 'I prefer sunset, the light is softer. good composiiton', '2003-07-31 12:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(372434, 30757, 806, '<td valign="top">nicely done... the focus is great, and you had such patience to get the right angle! The front of the butterfly is a bit in shadow, and I know brightening that up would cause the back (upper right) to be over exposed... but this is the only nit pick I have about the image.</td>', 'nicely done... the focus is great, and you had such patience to get the right angle! The front of the butterfly is a bit in shadow, and I know brightening that up would cause the back (upper right) to be over exposed... but this is the only nit pick I have about the image.', '2003-07-31 12:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
