(372516, 31225, 806, '<td valign="top">I love this. I don''t know why. I don''t usually like this sort of thing. <br/>The roundness and smooth quality of the stones, and the way they are stacked creates a sense of tentative balance. The lighting is perfect and the colors amazing. This is - imho - very Zen (in my limited understanding of the word). Marvelous interpretation. Marvelous job!</td>', 'I love this. I don''t know why. I don''t usually like this sort of thing. The roundness and smooth quality of the stones, and the way they are stacked creates a sense of tentative balance. The lighting is perfect and the colors amazing. This is - imho - very Zen (in my limited understanding of the word). Marvelous interpretation. Marvelous job!', '2003-07-31 12:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
