(372846, 30978, 10626, '<td valign="top">This show is well composed and the idea is very good. It''s not easy to photograph this kind of wild and fast tiny animals, but you gotta work out on the exposure of the photo in the future. I would have used more aperture to get the lizard more in focus while the background remains blury.  It''s a good photo thou, GOOD LUCK.</td>', 'This show is well composed and the idea is very good. It''s not easy to photograph this kind of wild and fast tiny animals, but you gotta work out on the exposure of the photo in the future. I would have used more aperture to get the lizard more in focus while the background remains blury.  It''s a good photo thou, GOOD LUCK.', '2003-07-31 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
