(372954, 30957, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice composition though it seems a little soft on the focus.  Also, use of a reflector above the flower may of helped to get more light on your subject.</td>', 'Nice composition though it seems a little soft on the focus.  Also, use of a reflector above the flower may of helped to get more light on your subject.', '2003-07-31 20:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(372955, 30847, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is so typical of M. Jean-Jacques Beguin I''m almost prepared to say so in this comment: I don''t know of anyone else here who can capture this kind of tonal quality - and if you''re not JJ then this is about the highest compliment I could pay.</td>', 'This is so typical of M. Jean-Jacques Beguin I''m almost prepared to say so in this comment: I don''t know of anyone else here who can capture this kind of tonal quality - and if you''re not JJ then this is about the highest compliment I could pay.', '2003-07-31 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(372957, 30268, 10040, '<td valign="top">I personally like this photo a lot.  The colors in the flowers are very striking and the subject is gorgeous.  I really like the top that she is wearing because I think it enhances the flower and the garden concept, however, I think the grey underwear distracts from the rest of the colors in the photograph.  White may have been a better choice or maybe even black to match her hair color.  I still may have lost the bra though.  The small wisp of hair on her face which is out of place distracts a little as well, but at this point I am just being nit-picky.  Now I may be wrong about this one, but a fill flash might have been nice to remove the shadows from her left forearm and her thighs.  I still think it''s a great shot though :)</td>', 'I personally like this photo a lot.  The colors in the flowers are very striking and the subject is gorgeous.  I really like the top that she is wearing because I think it enhances the flower and the garden concept, however, I think the grey underwear distracts from the rest of the colors in the photograph.  White may have been a better choice or maybe even black to match her hair color.  I still may have lost the bra though.  The small wisp of hair on her face which is out of place distracts a little as well, but at this point I am just being nit-picky.  Now I may be wrong about this one, but a fill flash might have been nice to remove the shadows from her left forearm and her thighs.  I still think it''s a great shot though :)', '2003-07-31 20:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(372959, 31168, 7743, '<td valign="top">Did you get a postcard?</td>', 'Did you get a postcard?', '2003-07-31 20:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(372961, 30405, 7743, '<td valign="top">Your choice of diagonal presentation works here.  You probably could have gone a bit more.  With respect to lighting the bottom part of the image is a little dark.  This is probably due  to the brightness at the top of your image.  Use of a reflector could possible solve this.</td>', 'Your choice of diagonal presentation works here.  You probably could have gone a bit more.  With respect to lighting the bottom part of the image is a little dark.  This is probably due  to the brightness at the top of your image.  Use of a reflector could possible solve this.', '2003-07-31 20:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(372962, 31144, 10040, '<td valign="top">I personally love pictures of dragonflies and this one is an excellent one.  Great colors and in focus too!  Nothing worse than an out of focus macro.  The water drops on the leaf really add to this shot.  Very nice.</td>', 'I personally love pictures of dragonflies and this one is an excellent one.  Great colors and in focus too!  Nothing worse than an out of focus macro.  The water drops on the leaf really add to this shot.  Very nice.', '2003-07-31 20:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(372963, 31012, 10040, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I really like the color of the yellow in the flower.  Staged or real?</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I really like the color of the yellow in the flower.  Staged or real?', '2003-07-31 20:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(372964, 30997, 7743, '<td valign="top">The light falling between the corn stalks is interesting along with the pattern in the parched ground.  Impact could possibly be improved by increasing the contrast between the shafts of light and the dirt.<br/> <br/>The gnome is a cute touch but I don''t think was necessary.    Did you try this vertically and/or without the gnome?</td>', 'The light falling between the corn stalks is interesting along with the pattern in the parched ground.  Impact could possibly be improved by increasing the contrast between the shafts of light and the dirt. The gnome is a cute touch but I don''t think was necessary.    Did you try this vertically and/or without the gnome?', '2003-07-31 20:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(372965, 31128, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The bright area at the top is distracting.  Cropping it out and taking this from a lower perspective could possibly add impact.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The bright area at the top is distracting.  Cropping it out and taking this from a lower perspective could possibly add impact.', '2003-07-31 20:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
