(373095, 30216, 6359, '<td valign="top">I assume you are talking about the snail. The flower takes away from the snail.<br/>Do me a favor and bring up your picture and scroll down until the green flower is about 1/3 from the top. then minumize your browser and move so half of the picture  is in view (snail side of course). I think this would enphasize the snail and may have got a better score from me. Currently a 4</td>', 'I assume you are talking about the snail. The flower takes away from the snail.Do me a favor and bring up your picture and scroll down until the green flower is about 1/3 from the top. then minumize your browser and move so half of the picture  is in view (snail side of course). I think this would enphasize the snail and may have got a better score from me. Currently a 4', '2003-07-31 23:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
