(373474, 30216, 4482, '<td valign="top">What a lovely flower..... even though you have a lovely snail in there and the photo as a general rule is good, due to the bright colors of the flower compared to the rest of the photo, IMO the flower is the main subject therefore doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'What a lovely flower..... even though you have a lovely snail in there and the photo as a general rule is good, due to the bright colors of the flower compared to the rest of the photo, IMO the flower is the main subject therefore doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2003-08-01 08:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
