(373970, 31097, 8860, '<td valign="top">Bit too muted and unclear. The shot looks noisy which may mean there wasn''t much light, or that you were using digital zoom. When using macro techniques you are drawing the viewer in to focus intently on your subject, so it really has to be sharp.</td>', 'Bit too muted and unclear. The shot looks noisy which may mean there wasn''t much light, or that you were using digital zoom. When using macro techniques you are drawing the viewer in to focus intently on your subject, so it really has to be sharp.', '2003-08-01 22:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
