(374492, 30874, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of the best the week.<br/> <br/>It is superior in numerous ways. Composition and cropping of the image is perfect. The flower complements your subject by adding color and interest to the image. It supports your subject both literally and photographically. The position, lighting and angle of the camera gives the monarch a majestic quality.<br/> <br/>Professional in every aspect.</td>', 'One of the best the week. It is superior in numerous ways. Composition and cropping of the image is perfect. The flower complements your subject by adding color and interest to the image. It supports your subject both literally and photographically. The position, lighting and angle of the camera gives the monarch a majestic quality. Professional in every aspect.', '2003-08-02 13:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(374493, 30851, 8130, '<td valign="top">Not a gecko, but a green anole, nice catch though!</td>', 'Not a gecko, but a green anole, nice catch though!', '2003-08-02 13:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(374494, 30230, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellant insect image. Well composed with good clarity. You subject is deserving of a much prettier landing pad.</td>', 'Excellant insect image. Well composed with good clarity. You subject is deserving of a much prettier landing pad.', '2003-08-02 13:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(374495, 31093, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful beetle macro. Focus is just right for the subject and wonderfully composed.<br/> <br/>You might want to suggest "get a room" to these two. :)</td>', 'Wonderful beetle macro. Focus is just right for the subject and wonderfully composed. You might want to suggest "get a room" to these two. :)', '2003-08-02 13:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(374496, 31094, 5792, '<td valign="top">You have turned an ordinary pine cone into a photographic superstar. <br/> <br/>It takes a great sense for beauty and a keen photographic eye to do that.<br/> <br/>The subtle greens and blue in this image are eye pleasing but the bright yellow/green pine cone is absolutely spectacular. <br/> <br/>Kudos to you.<br/> <br/>One of my favorites this challenge. <br/></td>', 'You have turned an ordinary pine cone into a photographic superstar.  It takes a great sense for beauty and a keen photographic eye to do that. The subtle greens and blue in this image are eye pleasing but the bright yellow/green pine cone is absolutely spectacular.  Kudos to you. One of my favorites this challenge. ', '2003-08-02 13:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(374497, 31219, 5792, '<td valign="top">Fascinating and technically exceptional. You have to admire a photographer as creative as this one. I tip my hat  off to you.</td>', 'Fascinating and technically exceptional. You have to admire a photographer as creative as this one. I tip my hat  off to you.', '2003-08-02 13:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
