(374508, 30676, 5792, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image and great color composition. The soft streaky green background to the left and upper right corner of the frame directs the eye to your subject.<br/> <br/>Nice capture.<br/> <br/>Everyone is clamoring to know, so I will just go ahead and ask up front for all of us:  Did you have to use special high speed flash units to capture stop action on this subject as it was speeding by?</td>', 'A beautiful image and great color composition. The soft streaky green background to the left and upper right corner of the frame directs the eye to your subject. Nice capture. Everyone is clamoring to know, so I will just go ahead and ask up front for all of us:  Did you have to use special high speed flash units to capture stop action on this subject as it was speeding by?', '2003-08-02 13:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(374509, 30266, 8155, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2003-08-02 13:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
