(375123, 31233, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty busy photo with the main topic (weelbarrow) not in focus.   I am not trying to be a smarty, but you have a lot of great subjects, and I think you should take a picture with any one of them up close to stand out as the subject of your photo.  The hose, the picket fence, and the wheelbarrow are all fighting for the center stage.  5</td>', 'This is a pretty busy photo with the main topic (weelbarrow) not in focus.   I am not trying to be a smarty, but you have a lot of great subjects, and I think you should take a picture with any one of them up close to stand out as the subject of your photo.  The hose, the picket fence, and the wheelbarrow are all fighting for the center stage.  5', '2003-08-03 11:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(375124, 31001, 2634, '<td valign="top">Great shot...I love the originality of it. Bumped it from 8 to 9.<br/>What really makes this pic - the splash of color from the people, the foggy trees in the background, the composition, DOF.......<br/>The only thing I might have changed would be to rotate it a touch to the left to bring the trees a drop straighter.</td>', 'Great shot...I love the originality of it. Bumped it from 8 to 9.What really makes this pic - the splash of color from the people, the foggy trees in the background, the composition, DOF.......The only thing I might have changed would be to rotate it a touch to the left to bring the trees a drop straighter.', '2003-08-03 11:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(375125, 31118, 1202, '<td valign="top">Sometimes you just gotta be satisfied with what you got.   If the poor little tree were placed closer to the thirds line it would become more predominate, making the picture more interesting, I think!  5</td>', 'Sometimes you just gotta be satisfied with what you got.   If the poor little tree were placed closer to the thirds line it would become more predominate, making the picture more interesting, I think!  5', '2003-08-03 11:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(375127, 31141, 2634, '<td valign="top">Great macro. Your DOF, colors and composition are great. You have excellent sharpness on the face and body. Great lighting also.</td>', 'Great macro. Your DOF, colors and composition are great. You have excellent sharpness on the face and body. Great lighting also.', '2003-08-03 11:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(375128, 30290, 1202, '<td valign="top">I say a bit overexposed,  (loss of detail in the string).  Is that a snail shell hidden in the bamboo?  Maybe that would have been a good subject by itself.  6</td>', 'I say a bit overexposed,  (loss of detail in the string).  Is that a snail shell hidden in the bamboo?  Maybe that would have been a good subject by itself.  6', '2003-08-03 11:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
