(375135, 31213, 1202, '<td valign="top">Back breaking work, thats why I don''t have one.  Just a little more contrast would improve the quality of your picture, and if the baren three rows were cropped out, bringing the gardener and the tiller more into play it would be super.   Good eye.  6</td>', 'Back breaking work, thats why I don''t have one.  Just a little more contrast would improve the quality of your picture, and if the baren three rows were cropped out, bringing the gardener and the tiller more into play it would be super.   Good eye.  6', '2003-08-03 11:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(375136, 30835, 1202, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The shadow on the leaf in the foreground is a bit distracting, I think it would be much stronger if the bright colors were throughout the subjects.  7</td>', 'Well done.  The shadow on the leaf in the foreground is a bit distracting, I think it would be much stronger if the bright colors were throughout the subjects.  7', '2003-08-03 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
