(375186, 31120, 2333, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition; the shadow is wonderful. Your title is a perfet choice, it evokes the mood you want to convey with a single word. Good use of soft focus.<br/>I have two suggestions:<br/> - Rotate to align the boards to vertical<br/> - Correct the slight barrel distortion to straighten the lines<br/>Well done all in all, a possible ribbon contender with just the right tweaks.</td>', 'Very nice composition; the shadow is wonderful. Your title is a perfet choice, it evokes the mood you want to convey with a single word. Good use of soft focus.I have two suggestions: - Rotate to align the boards to vertical - Correct the slight barrel distortion to straighten the linesWell done all in all, a possible ribbon contender with just the right tweaks.', '2003-08-03 13:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
