(375338, 30689, 3290, '<td valign="top">Sharp on the wings - shame we can''t see the face. And it would be nice if more of the flower were in focus.</td>', 'Sharp on the wings - shame we can''t see the face. And it would be nice if more of the flower were in focus.', '2003-08-03 17:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(375339, 31011, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nicely sharp on its back, but the head is a little soft, as are the wings, I like the composition.</td>', 'Nicely sharp on its back, but the head is a little soft, as are the wings, I like the composition.', '2003-08-03 17:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(375340, 30908, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2003-08-03 17:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(375342, 31238, 3290, '<td valign="top">This could be nice - it''s just rather too dark.</td>', 'This could be nice - it''s just rather too dark.', '2003-08-03 18:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(375344, 30736, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and composition, but could be sharper.</td>', 'Nice subject and composition, but could be sharper.', '2003-08-03 18:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(375346, 31168, 3290, '<td valign="top">:-)</td>', ':-)', '2003-08-03 18:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(375347, 31218, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2003-08-03 18:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(375348, 30929, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice bee macro. Good contrast with the colour of the flower and nice and sharp on the face. Good one.</td>', 'Nice bee macro. Good contrast with the colour of the flower and nice and sharp on the face. Good one.', '2003-08-03 18:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(375354, 30634, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and lighting - could be a little sharper, though.</td>', 'Nice detail and lighting - could be a little sharper, though.', '2003-08-03 18:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(375356, 30899, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, but lighting is somewhat harsh.</td>', 'Nice detail, but lighting is somewhat harsh.', '2003-08-03 18:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(375359, 30972, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lighting is harsh and the focus is soft. Attractive subject and nice composition, t hough.</td>', 'Lighting is harsh and the focus is soft. Attractive subject and nice composition, t hough.', '2003-08-03 18:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(375361, 30489, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Shame about the ugly feeder and there''s a lot of emopty space to the left of the bird.</td>', 'Nice catch. Shame about the ugly feeder and there''s a lot of emopty space to the left of the bird.', '2003-08-03 18:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(375362, 31144, 3290, '<td valign="top">Actually, it''s a damselfly, but this is a nice study - good sharpness and nice lighting. I know the water srops are attractive, but I think I''d crop some of the empty space on the right to let the insect occupy more of the shot.</td>', 'Actually, it''s a damselfly, but this is a nice study - good sharpness and nice lighting. I know the water srops are attractive, but I think I''d crop some of the empty space on the right to let the insect occupy more of the shot.', '2003-08-03 18:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(375363, 30431, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pleasant study.</td>', 'Pleasant study.', '2003-08-03 18:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(375365, 30281, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.</td>', 'Nice catch.', '2003-08-03 18:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(375368, 31091, 3290, '<td valign="top">Potentially good, but looks like it was spoiled by camera shake - also a little too dark.</td>', 'Potentially good, but looks like it was spoiled by camera shake - also a little too dark.', '2003-08-03 18:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(375373, 30874, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty subject. Sharpness is good and I like the stained glass effect, but it makes the shot seem a little dark. Perhaps a 1/2 stop more might have fixed this. I like the composition, too.</td>', 'Very pretty subject. Sharpness is good and I like the stained glass effect, but it makes the shot seem a little dark. Perhaps a 1/2 stop more might have fixed this. I like the composition, too.', '2003-08-03 18:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(375375, 30847, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pleasing colours and textures.</td>', 'Pleasing colours and textures.', '2003-08-03 18:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(375381, 31244, 3290, '<td valign="top">It certainly is. Good catch. Could be a little lighter and a little sharper. I''d crop off the flower/leaf above the snake.</td>', 'It certainly is. Good catch. Could be a little lighter and a little sharper. I''d crop off the flower/leaf above the snake.', '2003-08-03 18:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(375382, 30616, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2003-08-03 18:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(375388, 30943, 3290, '<td valign="top">Could be good, but the bug is lost amongst the green - crop out some of the stuff on the right (probably the right two leaves) and we''d see more of the bug.</td>', 'Could be good, but the bug is lost amongst the green - crop out some of the stuff on the right (probably the right two leaves) and we''d see more of the bug.', '2003-08-03 18:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(375390, 30303, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. The one on the right is a little soft round the head.</td>', 'Nice catch. The one on the right is a little soft round the head.', '2003-08-03 18:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(375395, 31219, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. Good idea well executed  -  like this a lot.</td>', 'Interesting effect. Good idea well executed  -  like this a lot.', '2003-08-03 18:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(375398, 30892, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective in the mirror - I like this one.</td>', 'Nice perspective in the mirror - I like this one.', '2003-08-03 18:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(375400, 30978, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the sharpest bit is on the ear - the eye would be better.</td>', 'Nice, but the sharpest bit is on the ear - the eye would be better.', '2003-08-03 18:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(375403, 31044, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but I think I''d have preferred it if you''d pulled back a bit.</td>', 'Pretty, but I think I''d have preferred it if you''d pulled back a bit.', '2003-08-03 18:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(375404, 30505, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, but hard to get in focus when they''re on the wing, aren''t they? :-)</td>', 'Nice catch, but hard to get in focus when they''re on the wing, aren''t they? :-)', '2003-08-03 18:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(375406, 30999, 3290, '<td valign="top">Wow. You certainly have a hotbed of passion there. Shame it''s a bit overexposed. Also, would probably be better to pick a pair and home in on them.</td>', 'Wow. You certainly have a hotbed of passion there. Shame it''s a bit overexposed. Also, would probably be better to pick a pair and home in on them.', '2003-08-03 18:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(375412, 31093, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Attractive subjects. Looks a little oversharpened and the lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Nice catch. Attractive subjects. Looks a little oversharpened and the lighting is a bit harsh.', '2003-08-03 18:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(375416, 30582, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint. Good colours. I think the lighting is just a little too much, but otherwise this is a bright, attractive shot. Well done.</td>', 'Great viewpoint. Good colours. I think the lighting is just a little too much, but otherwise this is a bright, attractive shot. Well done.', '2003-08-03 18:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(375420, 31001, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''d prefer it without the slight tilt.</td>', 'Very nice. I''d prefer it without the slight tilt.', '2003-08-03 18:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(375422, 30638, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good exposure. I think a viewpoint a bit more the to the left might have been better.</td>', 'Nice composition, good exposure. I think a viewpoint a bit more the to the left might have been better.', '2003-08-03 19:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(375423, 31181, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2003-08-03 19:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(375426, 31083, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good details and not bad DOF. Just a shame we can''t see its head.</td>', 'Good details and not bad DOF. Just a shame we can''t see its head.', '2003-08-03 19:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(375431, 31205, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - could be a little sharper, though.</td>', 'Nice capture - could be a little sharper, though.', '2003-08-03 19:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(375433, 31094, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich colours. I would prefer it if the cone weren''t so centred though.</td>', 'Lovely rich colours. I would prefer it if the cone weren''t so centred though.', '2003-08-03 19:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(375434, 30577, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lovely muted colours and a good composition. Nice.</td>', 'Lovely muted colours and a good composition. Nice.', '2003-08-03 19:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(375440, 31012, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good colours, good sharpness - good shot.</td>', 'Good colours, good sharpness - good shot.', '2003-08-03 19:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(375444, 31110, 3290, '<td valign="top">Attractive subject and good lighting. Shame about the bright spots in the background, but you have to take what you can get.</td>', 'Attractive subject and good lighting. Shame about the bright spots in the background, but you have to take what you can get.', '2003-08-03 19:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(375446, 31033, 3290, '<td valign="top">Looks nice, but is too small to really be able to tell.</td>', 'Looks nice, but is too small to really be able to tell.', '2003-08-03 19:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(375452, 30491, 3290, '<td valign="top">Effective</td>', 'Effective', '2003-08-03 19:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(375458, 31225, 3290, '<td valign="top">Attractive, simple, colourful. Beautiful. Could be the winner.</td>', 'Attractive, simple, colourful. Beautiful. Could be the winner.', '2003-08-03 19:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(375459, 30469, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice job of portraying the fragrance of a garden. The hairs in front of her face make the photo seem more spontaneous.</td>', 'Nice job of portraying the fragrance of a garden. The hairs in front of her face make the photo seem more spontaneous.', '2003-08-03 19:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(375463, 30874, 10402, '<td valign="top">Apt title; the lighting does make the wings looked like stained glass. Great capture.</td>', 'Apt title; the lighting does make the wings looked like stained glass. Great capture.', '2003-08-03 19:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(375483, 30587, 10402, '<td valign="top">It''s rare to capture depth in a silhouette, but you''ve done it here quite well.</td>', 'It''s rare to capture depth in a silhouette, but you''ve done it here quite well.', '2003-08-03 19:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(375486, 30191, 3735, '<td valign="top">I like how you blured the backgrown, &amp; the forgrown and sharppend the center  . I tried that this week and i got lots of neg. comments of the blured forgrown. You''rs looks better than mine anyway.  9</td>', 'I like how you blured the backgrown, & the forgrown and sharppend the center  . I tried that this week and i got lots of neg. comments of the blured forgrown. You''rs looks better than mine anyway.  9', '2003-08-03 19:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(375490, 30276, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF and composition though a little more contrast would help emphasize the ant.</td>', 'Good use of DOF and composition though a little more contrast would help emphasize the ant.', '2003-08-03 19:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(375491, 30933, 3735, '<td valign="top">he looks like some out of mid-evil days. Bet it would be scarrie to be a bug  9  good job</td>', 'he looks like some out of mid-evil days. Bet it would be scarrie to be a bug  9  good job', '2003-08-03 19:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(375496, 30624, 7743, '<td valign="top">Leading lines are used perfectly here.   A little more sharpness and depth of field would possibly give this image more appeal.</td>', 'Leading lines are used perfectly here.   A little more sharpness and depth of field would possibly give this image more appeal.', '2003-08-03 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(375498, 31159, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to use sepia here though it appears to be a little over exposed. Most likely due to the harsh lighting.  To compensate for this a diffuser and/or reflector may have helped to allow you to bring out more of the details in the shadows.</td>', 'Nice idea to use sepia here though it appears to be a little over exposed. Most likely due to the harsh lighting.  To compensate for this a diffuser and/or reflector may have helped to allow you to bring out more of the details in the shadows.', '2003-08-03 19:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(375503, 30892, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very creative composition (and title). The image in the mirror is slightly overexposed and not well resolved, and it would be nice if the foreground grapes were in focus. But I do think you succeeded in communicating the idea you intended.</td>', 'Very creative composition (and title). The image in the mirror is slightly overexposed and not well resolved, and it would be nice if the foreground grapes were in focus. But I do think you succeeded in communicating the idea you intended.', '2003-08-03 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(375508, 30959, 7743, '<td valign="top">Cute capture.  The lighting seems to be very extreme with a range from very dark to very bright.  A diffuser would have probably helped to bring the range within that that the camera could resolve without overexposing some areas (head, hand, wheelbarrow).</td>', 'Cute capture.  The lighting seems to be very extreme with a range from very dark to very bright.  A diffuser would have probably helped to bring the range within that that the camera could resolve without overexposing some areas (head, hand, wheelbarrow).', '2003-08-03 20:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
