(376120, 30830, 917, '<td valign="top">I thinks its a good idea, but composition is poor, and the full sun has caused overly bright areas on his hat and arm.</td>', 'I thinks its a good idea, but composition is poor, and the full sun has caused overly bright areas on his hat and arm.', '2003-08-04 09:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(376122, 30266, 917, '<td valign="top">I just love this, the way it goes against the challenge in such a bold manner. The fact thats its a well composed and shot picture too just makes it even better. One possible niggle is the position of the card, pehaps turning is anticlockwise about 10degrees would help the eye stay in the frame.</td>', 'I just love this, the way it goes against the challenge in such a bold manner. The fact thats its a well composed and shot picture too just makes it even better. One possible niggle is the position of the card, pehaps turning is anticlockwise about 10degrees would help the eye stay in the frame.', '2003-08-04 09:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(376126, 30463, 917, '<td valign="top">The first thing I see is the dark stem rather than your drops. Try getting more light onto the stem to stop it being the main subject.</td>', 'The first thing I see is the dark stem rather than your drops. Try getting more light onto the stem to stop it being the main subject.', '2003-08-04 09:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
