(376363, 31004, 8530, '<td valign="top">While it''s true that a lot of people barbecue in their yard/garden, this area they''re in looks wild enough to not convey that strongly to me. Also, I''m not sure what you did with the color in this but I don''t care for it and it looks overly processed.</td>', 'While it''s true that a lot of people barbecue in their yard/garden, this area they''re in looks wild enough to not convey that strongly to me. Also, I''m not sure what you did with the color in this but I don''t care for it and it looks overly processed.', '2003-08-04 13:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
