(376637, 31235, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love this, because it reminds me of home.  My parents are in Nuevo Mexico, and this is very much reminds me of there.</td>', 'I love this, because it reminds me of home.  My parents are in Nuevo Mexico, and this is very much reminds me of there.', '2003-08-04 18:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(376638, 30281, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great detail, esp on the wing.</td>', 'Great detail, esp on the wing.', '2003-08-04 18:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(376644, 30300, 1280, '<td valign="top">Yummy...good job</td>', 'Yummy...good job', '2003-08-04 19:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(376648, 31129, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like your idea.  I think if you turned the camera so you''d get the whole sculpture, and eliminate the out of focus bg this could be much better.  Hope this helps.  Best of luck! :-)</td>', 'I like your idea.  I think if you turned the camera so you''d get the whole sculpture, and eliminate the out of focus bg this could be much better.  Hope this helps.  Best of luck! :-)', '2003-08-04 19:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(376653, 31072, 1280, '<td valign="top">Usually it''s best to isolate your subject from distracting elements that don''t really add to the shot.  The arm and leg from the other character should be completely cropped out.  The best way is to do it before you shoot.  By turning the camera lengthwise you would crop the unwanted and would have been able to include all of your subject without cutting the feet off. <br/>I sincerely hope this helps.  Best of luck!  :-)<br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Grayce</td>', 'Usually it''s best to isolate your subject from distracting elements that don''t really add to the shot.  The arm and leg from the other character should be completely cropped out.  The best way is to do it before you shoot.  By turning the camera lengthwise you would crop the unwanted and would have been able to include all of your subject without cutting the feet off. I sincerely hope this helps.  Best of luck!  :-)Regards, Grayce', '2003-08-04 19:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(376655, 31232, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this interesting texture.</td>', 'I like this interesting texture.', '2003-08-04 19:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(376658, 30625, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pleasant scene.  Would be even better if you cropped the over exposed plant out from the left.  Also would have then placed the bird off center which is usually bettter.  Hope that helps!  :-)<br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Grayce</td>', 'Pleasant scene.  Would be even better if you cropped the over exposed plant out from the left.  Also would have then placed the bird off center which is usually bettter.  Hope that helps!  :-)Regards, Grayce', '2003-08-04 19:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
