(376696, 30503, 8891, '<td valign="top">nice attempt, don''t feel it worked because of  the distraction of the flower....</td>', 'nice attempt, don''t feel it worked because of  the distraction of the flower....', '2003-08-04 20:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(376697, 30283, 8891, '<td valign="top">Good colors, just a bit bright</td>', 'Good colors, just a bit bright', '2003-08-04 20:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(376698, 30894, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect by focusing on the fence.   The fence probably needs to be a bit more substantial to make this work since the eye is constantly drawn to the out of focus wheelbarrow.</td>', 'Interesting effect by focusing on the fence.   The fence probably needs to be a bit more substantial to make this work since the eye is constantly drawn to the out of focus wheelbarrow.', '2003-08-04 20:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(376699, 30924, 8891, '<td valign="top">maybe it''s the lighting or the angle but it just doesn''t look like he is actually laying down. It looks like you just creatively rotated the pic to give it that appearance.</td>', 'maybe it''s the lighting or the angle but it just doesn''t look like he is actually laying down. It looks like you just creatively rotated the pic to give it that appearance.', '2003-08-04 20:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(376700, 30193, 8891, '<td valign="top">cute, nice comp, just too much shadow on Tom.</td>', 'cute, nice comp, just too much shadow on Tom.', '2003-08-04 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(376702, 30995, 8891, '<td valign="top">These guys again...wow is the round compeitition....Gardening = farming?....hmmm. exposure problmens</td>', 'These guys again...wow is the round compeitition....Gardening = farming?....hmmm. exposure problmens', '2003-08-04 20:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(376704, 30949, 8891, '<td valign="top">The 2 red berries up frront are bothersome.</td>', 'The 2 red berries up frront are bothersome.', '2003-08-04 20:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(376705, 30919, 7743, '<td valign="top">Mr. Hush Puppie is overexposed.  There''s no detail in the white areas.</td>', 'Mr. Hush Puppie is overexposed.  There''s no detail in the white areas.', '2003-08-04 20:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(376706, 30492, 8891, '<td valign="top">very nice comp, the exposure is on the verge of blow out....might try a polarizer or some other filter to tone it down. and make the colors richer.</td>', 'very nice comp, the exposure is on the verge of blow out....might try a polarizer or some other filter to tone it down. and make the colors richer.', '2003-08-04 20:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(376708, 31054, 7743, '<td valign="top">Having your center of interest ( I presume it''s the object at the center of the web) out of focus does not work here.  If there was nothing in the web at all and this was just an image of a spider web then it would work better.  You have captured some nice detail in the foreground to serve this alternative purpose.</td>', 'Having your center of interest ( I presume it''s the object at the center of the web) out of focus does not work here.  If there was nothing in the web at all and this was just an image of a spider web then it would work better.  You have captured some nice detail in the foreground to serve this alternative purpose.', '2003-08-04 20:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(376725, 30266, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I think I''d have preferred a bit more depth of field.</td>', 'Great idea, but I think I''d have preferred a bit more depth of field.', '2003-08-04 21:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(376731, 31068, 1202, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting growth that the grape vine has taken.  NIce job of getting a different perspective for the garden challenge.   6</td>', 'That''s an interesting growth that the grape vine has taken.  NIce job of getting a different perspective for the garden challenge.   6', '2003-08-04 21:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(376738, 30736, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice macro</td>', 'nice macro', '2003-08-04 21:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(376739, 30281, 7810, '<td valign="top">very cool shot</td>', 'very cool shot', '2003-08-04 21:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(376742, 31094, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2003-08-04 21:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(376744, 31115, 10441, '<td valign="top">In the garden?  I apologize for the misunderstanding.  I guess I need to become more aware of where things are done in other parts of the world.  This is an interesting perspective.</td>', 'In the garden?  I apologize for the misunderstanding.  I guess I need to become more aware of where things are done in other parts of the world.  This is an interesting perspective.', '2003-08-04 21:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(376745, 30593, 2158, '<td valign="top">All I can say is "WOW".  Looks like a winner to me.</td>', 'All I can say is "WOW".  Looks like a winner to me.', '2003-08-04 21:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(376746, 31131, 7743, '<td valign="top">The leading line of the waterfall and the curved edges of the pond project a nice relaxed mood. <br/> <br/>There seems to be a colour cast (magenta?) on this image.  In camera I couldn''t tell you how to fix this other than play with the white balance.  In post processing you could adjust the colour balance slightly more towards green (opposite of magenta).</td>', 'The leading line of the waterfall and the curved edges of the pond project a nice relaxed mood.  There seems to be a colour cast (magenta?) on this image.  In camera I couldn''t tell you how to fix this other than play with the white balance.  In post processing you could adjust the colour balance slightly more towards green (opposite of magenta).', '2003-08-04 21:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(376749, 30143, 7743, '<td valign="top">You''ve picked a difficult situation to photograph, black subject in very bright light.  In order to capture enough detail in the dog you need to expose a little bit more but in doing so you would blow out the bright areas which are already somewhat overexposed.  To try and correct this you might try using a diffuser.</td>', 'You''ve picked a difficult situation to photograph, black subject in very bright light.  In order to capture enough detail in the dog you need to expose a little bit more but in doing so you would blow out the bright areas which are already somewhat overexposed.  To try and correct this you might try using a diffuser.', '2003-08-04 22:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(376751, 30720, 7743, '<td valign="top">The water pump in your image has a lot of character.  The watering cans in the foreground take away from this.  Did you try shots of just the water pump?  Sepia or B/W could probably be used quite affectively here.</td>', 'The water pump in your image has a lot of character.  The watering cans in the foreground take away from this.  Did you try shots of just the water pump?  Sepia or B/W could probably be used quite affectively here.', '2003-08-04 22:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(376753, 30170, 3308, '<td valign="top">Great use of color and texture, light and shadow.  Beautiful greens.</td>', 'Great use of color and texture, light and shadow.  Beautiful greens.', '2003-08-04 22:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(376754, 30112, 7743, '<td valign="top">Your main subject is very sharp and captures the viewer''s attention immediately but the light coloured leaf on the left is distracting.  Cropping it out would probably balance the image better.</td>', 'Your main subject is very sharp and captures the viewer''s attention immediately but the light coloured leaf on the left is distracting.  Cropping it out would probably balance the image better.', '2003-08-04 22:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(376755, 30945, 10265, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts and details - 8.</td>', 'Nice contrasts and details - 8.', '2003-08-04 22:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(376756, 31177, 10265, '<td valign="top">Great shot with beautiful contrasts and details. You´rs the best IMO. I rated this a 9.</td>', 'Great shot with beautiful contrasts and details. You´rs the best IMO. I rated this a 9.', '2003-08-04 22:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(376758, 30582, 10265, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture with warm colors. Delicious! This is an 8 IMO!</td>', 'Really nice picture with warm colors. Delicious! This is an 8 IMO!', '2003-08-04 22:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(376759, 30949, 10265, '<td valign="top">Hey - nice DOF and good contrast. The frame does not make the picture better in my opinion. I gave you an 8.</td>', 'Hey - nice DOF and good contrast. The frame does not make the picture better in my opinion. I gave you an 8.', '2003-08-04 22:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(376760, 31012, 10265, '<td valign="top">Lovely details and great color. This is an 8 IMO.</td>', 'Lovely details and great color. This is an 8 IMO.', '2003-08-04 22:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(376762, 31205, 3308, '<td valign="top">This is really a great shot.  Even if the insect wasn''t in the picture, this would still be visually stunning, but the bug gives it that little something extra.  I love the muted colors and shapes.  My favorite so far.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is really a great shot.  Even if the insect wasn''t in the picture, this would still be visually stunning, but the bug gives it that little something extra.  I love the muted colors and shapes.  My favorite so far.  Good luck!', '2003-08-04 22:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(376768, 30751, 6325, '<td valign="top">Fun garden.</td>', 'Fun garden.', '2003-08-04 23:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(376780, 30315, 9232, '<td valign="top">Could have been a tighter shot to lose the hot light on the planter</td>', 'Could have been a tighter shot to lose the hot light on the planter', '2003-08-04 23:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(376782, 31185, 9232, '<td valign="top">The dew doesn''t show up enought to be a central subject in this IMO.  The light is very hot behind the plant.</td>', 'The dew doesn''t show up enought to be a central subject in this IMO.  The light is very hot behind the plant.', '2003-08-04 23:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(376784, 30345, 9232, '<td valign="top">sadly out of focus as this appears to be a nice composition</td>', 'sadly out of focus as this appears to be a nice composition', '2003-08-04 23:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(376785, 30267, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Could use a little more light on the left to bring out the details in the feathers.  A reflector could possibly do this quite nicely but then you''d need three hands.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Could use a little more light on the left to bring out the details in the feathers.  A reflector could possibly do this quite nicely but then you''d need three hands.', '2003-08-04 23:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(376787, 30908, 9232, '<td valign="top">Good angle</td>', 'Good angle', '2003-08-04 23:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(376788, 30601, 7743, '<td valign="top">The bottom right looks like a hedgehog.  The texture captured in the bottom third is well done but the bright spot in the top third is distracting.  Even if this were cropped out the image would probably still be balanced.  The curved line in the middle is a nice touch.</td>', 'The bottom right looks like a hedgehog.  The texture captured in the bottom third is well done but the bright spot in the top third is distracting.  Even if this were cropped out the image would probably still be balanced.  The curved line in the middle is a nice touch.', '2003-08-04 23:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(376789, 30556, 9232, '<td valign="top">Creative interpretation but it just doesn''t put me in mind of a garden.  I hope it does well with others - 7</td>', 'Creative interpretation but it just doesn''t put me in mind of a garden.  I hope it does well with others - 7', '2003-08-04 23:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
