(377220, 30919, 1202, '<td valign="top">It looks like he has about as much ambition as I have.  Can I change your title?  He looks like a "Guarden Dog" to me.   IMO your pic is just a tad overexposed making the top of his head wash out.   Your light meter probably picked up its reading in a dark area of the shot causing the lighter areas to be over exposed.  He is great though.  6</td>', 'It looks like he has about as much ambition as I have.  Can I change your title?  He looks like a "Guarden Dog" to me.   IMO your pic is just a tad overexposed making the top of his head wash out.   Your light meter probably picked up its reading in a dark area of the shot causing the lighter areas to be over exposed.  He is great though.  6', '2003-08-05 12:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
