(377227, 31105, 10888, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line with the fence. The only thing I might have different is time of day photo was taken!<br/>Looks like mid afternoon. Try moring or real late afternoon!  Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice leading line with the fence. The only thing I might have different is time of day photo was taken!Looks like mid afternoon. Try moring or real late afternoon!  Nice shot!', '2003-08-05 12:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
