(377267, 30617, 9886, '<td valign="top">NIce shot, but could''ve done with being a bit sharper ... I guess this was cropped a fair bit. Also perhaps the wings could''ve fitted inside the shot. Lovely subject.</td>', 'NIce shot, but could''ve done with being a bit sharper ... I guess this was cropped a fair bit. Also perhaps the wings could''ve fitted inside the shot. Lovely subject.', '2003-08-05 12:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
