(377359, 30270, 9295, '<td valign="top">The colors and lighting are wonderful in this shot, but it lacks in overall appeal. The green cloth draping the basket (or whatever you have the produce resting on) is bland (the cucumbers disappear into it) and you can see little bits of it peeking out at the bottom. Tthe placement is neither directly center or off-center enough to seem purposeful.</td>', 'The colors and lighting are wonderful in this shot, but it lacks in overall appeal. The green cloth draping the basket (or whatever you have the produce resting on) is bland (the cucumbers disappear into it) and you can see little bits of it peeking out at the bottom. Tthe placement is neither directly center or off-center enough to seem purposeful.', '2003-08-05 15:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(377361, 30678, 9295, '<td valign="top">All in all a nice shot but I would have liked it better off-center with the grapes to the left more.</td>', 'All in all a nice shot but I would have liked it better off-center with the grapes to the left more.', '2003-08-05 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
