(377412, 30847, 3575, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Wonderful composition and perfect exposure. I like the long DOF for this shot. Just one thing I don''t like is the little brown knobby thing in the upper right. Other than that, very nice.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Wonderful composition and perfect exposure. I like the long DOF for this shot. Just one thing I don''t like is the little brown knobby thing in the upper right. Other than that, very nice.', '2003-08-05 16:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
