(377685, 30266, 8981, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I almost didn''t get this one.  I''m glad I took a minute and thought about it.  Very good on the creativity.  You get bonus points for that.</td>', 'Wow!  I almost didn''t get this one.  I''m glad I took a minute and thought about it.  Very good on the creativity.  You get bonus points for that.', '2003-08-05 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(377686, 30520, 8981, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  The mood transfers to the viewer very well.  I got really sad when I looked at it, and to me that''s one of the signs of a great photographer.  Great job!</td>', 'I really like this photo.  The mood transfers to the viewer very well.  I got really sad when I looked at it, and to me that''s one of the signs of a great photographer.  Great job!', '2003-08-05 22:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(377687, 31093, 8981, '<td valign="top">Ummm, can I ask what the beetles are doing?  Maybe this should be X rated?  Great macro by the way.</td>', 'Ummm, can I ask what the beetles are doing?  Maybe this should be X rated?  Great macro by the way.', '2003-08-05 22:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(377688, 31185, 8981, '<td valign="top">I think that the bright background actually takes away from this picture.  It''s very hard to see the dew and the bottom half of the picture is covered in shadow unfortunatly.  I think you had the right idea and I think maybe just a different angle would have worked.  Good Job.</td>', 'I think that the bright background actually takes away from this picture.  It''s very hard to see the dew and the bottom half of the picture is covered in shadow unfortunatly.  I think you had the right idea and I think maybe just a different angle would have worked.  Good Job.', '2003-08-05 22:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(377689, 30463, 8981, '<td valign="top">Oooh, this looks like eye-candy!  I love the rich greens and the defined water drops!</td>', 'Oooh, this looks like eye-candy!  I love the rich greens and the defined water drops!', '2003-08-05 22:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
