(377721, 31225, 7969, '<td valign="top">lighting and colors are really great, also being able to sense the texture of the rocks, great job</td>', 'lighting and colors are really great, also being able to sense the texture of the rocks, great job', '2003-08-05 23:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(377723, 30908, 7969, '<td valign="top">great strategy to get an otherwise overexposed shot to be very intriguing.  Was it a blue filter?</td>', 'great strategy to get an otherwise overexposed shot to be very intriguing.  Was it a blue filter?', '2003-08-05 23:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(377726, 31225, 8159, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, the shadows on the rocks from the overhead lighting doesn''t "fit" with the "late sunset" background. Other than that, a great composition.</td>', 'In my opinion, the shadows on the rocks from the overhead lighting doesn''t "fit" with the "late sunset" background. Other than that, a great composition.', '2003-08-05 23:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(377728, 30894, 8159, '<td valign="top">I would have tried to focus on the garden and not on the chicken-wire fence. Because the fence is in focus, it looks like it is the subject of your photo...</td>', 'I would have tried to focus on the garden and not on the chicken-wire fence. Because the fence is in focus, it looks like it is the subject of your photo...', '2003-08-05 23:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(377733, 31165, 8981, '<td valign="top">I like the shot alot!  I love how you set it up, it really made me smile.  I don''t think you needed the border though, I think it''s great just as a picture.</td>', 'I like the shot alot!  I love how you set it up, it really made me smile.  I don''t think you needed the border though, I think it''s great just as a picture.', '2003-08-06 00:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(377734, 30751, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and an interesting composition...  The strong difference between the subdued tones in the foreground and the nearly washed-out gravel in the background, however, seems to almost ''tear'' the scene apart.  My eye is drawn to the texture and shape of the wheel, but almost immediately drawn away and fixates on the gravel.  --6</td>', 'Very nice lighting and an interesting composition...  The strong difference between the subdued tones in the foreground and the nearly washed-out gravel in the background, however, seems to almost ''tear'' the scene apart.  My eye is drawn to the texture and shape of the wheel, but almost immediately drawn away and fixates on the gravel.  --6', '2003-08-06 00:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(377735, 30268, 8981, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous!</td>', 'This is gorgeous!', '2003-08-06 00:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(377736, 31124, 7033, '<td valign="top">Kind of an odd shot, but I really like the perspective and the use of a fairly shallow depth-of-field.</td>', 'Kind of an odd shot, but I really like the perspective and the use of a fairly shallow depth-of-field.', '2003-08-06 00:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
