(378230, 31238, 9854, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to see how this was ranked. But a classy shot is a classy shot, that not everyone will recognize.</td>', 'I''m sorry to see how this was ranked. But a classy shot is a classy shot, that not everyone will recognize.', '2003-08-06 05:55:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(378233, 30929, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hey I got that lens too, why can''t I take such pics?? :-)<br/> <br/>Congrats Jacko, way up there again!<br/></td>', 'Hey I got that lens too, why can''t I take such pics?? :-) Congrats Jacko, way up there again!', '2003-08-06 05:58:22.000000', NULL, 0),
