(378441, 30679, 9295, '<td valign="top">I am very surprised this didn''t score higher. It''s a beautiful photo both in composition and creativity.  I''m dismayed by the person who gave you only a 3 because it didn''t fit the challenge. There was nothing in the challenge that said it had to be a flower garden and, I don''t know about the rest of the world, but here in Illinois, you see LOTS of personal vegetable gardens growing corn. I do like the suggestion someone made that perhaps keeping the ear of corn yellow would make it stand out more. That might look cool, kind of like the "Glory" photo in your gallery. In any case, it deserved a higher rating. IMHO.</td>', 'I am very surprised this didn''t score higher. It''s a beautiful photo both in composition and creativity.  I''m dismayed by the person who gave you only a 3 because it didn''t fit the challenge. There was nothing in the challenge that said it had to be a flower garden and, I don''t know about the rest of the world, but here in Illinois, you see LOTS of personal vegetable gardens growing corn. I do like the suggestion someone made that perhaps keeping the ear of corn yellow would make it stand out more. That might look cool, kind of like the "Glory" photo in your gallery. In any case, it deserved a higher rating. IMHO.', '2003-08-06 08:43:59.000000', NULL, 0),
