(378838, 30629, 4615, '<td valign="top">Okay:<br/> <br/>This certainly fits the challeng. There is some sharp detail in the leaves.  The blurred background almost hints at a sense of the mysterious, but overall, the photo lacks "tension", giving the impression of being a detail or fragment of some larger picture.  Kind of a photo of nothing in paticular, apart from the dark rectangle of iron dissecting the center.  Perhaps the iron could have been more in focus.<br/> <br/>Good luck to you in future challenges.<br/></td>', 'Okay: This certainly fits the challeng. There is some sharp detail in the leaves.  The blurred background almost hints at a sense of the mysterious, but overall, the photo lacks "tension", giving the impression of being a detail or fragment of some larger picture.  Kind of a photo of nothing in paticular, apart from the dark rectangle of iron dissecting the center.  Perhaps the iron could have been more in focus. Good luck to you in future challenges.', '2003-08-06 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 0),
