(378878, 30593, 5705, '<td valign="top">Thank you everone who voted and gave me all the nice comments.<br/>The grasshopper was alive and well during the shoot, I used Shiz''s techinique of capturing him and put him in a jar for awhile to calm him down..<br/> <br/>That was the first time I had a pic flirting between high 6 and low 7''s and it is STRESSFULL-- I don''t know how all of you regular ribbon getters handle it--<br/> <br/>Thanks again everyone, and congrats to all the other ribbon getters and to all the top 10-- great pics..</td>', 'Thank you everone who voted and gave me all the nice comments.The grasshopper was alive and well during the shoot, I used Shiz''s techinique of capturing him and put him in a jar for awhile to calm him down.. That was the first time I had a pic flirting between high 6 and low 7''s and it is STRESSFULL-- I don''t know how all of you regular ribbon getters handle it-- Thanks again everyone, and congrats to all the other ribbon getters and to all the top 10-- great pics..', '2003-08-06 14:46:17.000000', NULL, 0),
