(382985, 30268, 9889, '<td valign="top">I did not vote for this challenge.<br/> <br/>I would have rated the pic 8, not 10, because somehow I find it a bit unnatural, even if I like it.<br/> <br/>However, I do not understand how people can rate a pic of this quality with anything between 1 and 4....<br/>That really spoils the challenge outcome.. doesn''t it?<br/> <br/>The topic stated: <br/> <br/><i>the main subject of your photograph may NOT be a flower.</i> <br/> <br/>Then I cannot really understand how this pic can be criticized for the presence of flowers... is there anybody who thinks that the main subject of this photo is a flower??<br/></td>', 'I did not vote for this challenge. I would have rated the pic 8, not 10, because somehow I find it a bit unnatural, even if I like it. However, I do not understand how people can rate a pic of this quality with anything between 1 and 4....That really spoils the challenge outcome.. doesn''t it? The topic stated:  the main subject of your photograph may NOT be a flower.  Then I cannot really understand how this pic can be criticized for the presence of flowers... is there anybody who thinks that the main subject of this photo is a flower??', '2003-08-10 06:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
