(405031, 31070, 10084, '<td valign="top">You have an intersting composition here. The vine wrapping around the tree trunk is pretty cool. You made want to desaturate the tree trunk into b&amp;w and bring out the color of the vine. This will give the image a more powerful impact. <a href="//www.pbase.com/image/20838227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Click</a> for what I mean. If you don''t want me to keep it up, let me know and I''ll take it down.<br/> <br/>Hope it helps.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-31 02:54:37.</i></td>', 'You have an intersting composition here. The vine wrapping around the tree trunk is pretty cool. You made want to desaturate the tree trunk into b&w and bring out the color of the vine. This will give the image a more powerful impact. Click for what I mean. If you don''t want me to keep it up, let me know and I''ll take it down. Hope it helps.', '2003-08-31 03:28:51.000000', '2003-08-31 03:54:37.000000', 0),
