(530380, 30486, 12796, '<td valign="top">The shot is really great. But wouldnt it have been more superb if u took it from the straight head on head angle? the tail would have been symmetric and would have made a more appealing shot. I''m not anyway saying that your current show isnt appealing. I''m just trying to stress on possible ways to improve the shot. Perhaps there wouldnt have been such a chance because of heavy crowd or various other reasons. Otherwise i know you would have certainly tried every good angle! Good Luck!</td>', 'The shot is really great. But wouldnt it have been more superb if u took it from the straight head on head angle? the tail would have been symmetric and would have made a more appealing shot. I''m not anyway saying that your current show isnt appealing. I''m just trying to stress on possible ways to improve the shot. Perhaps there wouldnt have been such a chance because of heavy crowd or various other reasons. Otherwise i know you would have certainly tried every good angle! Good Luck!', '2004-01-03 05:27:58.000000', NULL, 0),
