(2856070, 30908, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hi Matthes,<br/> <br/>Judging from your portfolio, I suspect you have a very nice monitor. Thanks for over-looking what was more then likely, an over-exposed photo on my part. That my friend, was the luck of the draw. (wink) Anyway, to celebrate, I''m picking a new ''favorite photo'' from your collection. This photo is sad to me but I really like it. I wonder how they got underwater? Flood...filling a new lake? I love the color blue and trees too. I also can respect what was probably a difficult photo to take. Being underwater scares the heck out of me. So, I''ll enjoy the view while safely viewing your photo at the comfort of my desk. Thanks!<br/> <br/>Take care,<br/>Brad<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi Matthes, Judging from your portfolio, I suspect you have a very nice monitor. Thanks for over-looking what was more then likely, an over-exposed photo on my part. That my friend, was the luck of the draw. (wink) Anyway, to celebrate, I''m picking a new ''favorite photo'' from your collection. This photo is sad to me but I really like it. I wonder how they got underwater? Flood...filling a new lake? I love the color blue and trees too. I also can respect what was probably a difficult photo to take. Being underwater scares the heck out of me. So, I''ll enjoy the view while safely viewing your photo at the comfort of my desk. Thanks! Take care,Brad ', '2006-09-22 06:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
