(5871105, 30268, 100773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glimpses:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/> <br/>The topic stated: <br/> <br/><i>the main subject of your photograph may NOT be a flower.</i> <br/> <br/>Then I cannot really understand how this pic can be criticized for the presence of flowers... is there anybody who thinks that the main subject of this photo is a flower?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m quoting this 7 years after the challenge, but I had to say this..<br/> <br/>Here goes... Who said she ain''t a flower ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by glimpses:  The topic stated:  the main subject of your photograph may NOT be a flower.  Then I cannot really understand how this pic can be criticized for the presence of flowers... is there anybody who thinks that the main subject of this photo is a flower??   I''m quoting this 7 years after the challenge, but I had to say this.. Here goes... Who said she ain''t a flower ;)', '2010-02-17 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 0),
